color.', 'Sacrifice all creatures you control, then create that many 4/4 red Hellion creature tokens.', 'Search your library for up to three Aura cards with different names, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal those cards, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", 'Target opponent loses 2 life for each Swamp you control. Last Stand deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control. Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each Forest you control. You gain 2 life for each Plains you control. Draw a card for each Island you control, then discard that many cards.', "Tormented Soul can't block and can't be blocked.", 'Trample, lifelink\\nSpells you cast that target Elderwood Scion cost {2} less to cast.\\nSpells your opponents cast that target Elderwood Scion cost {2} more to cast.', 'Vivid Creek enters the battlefield tapped with two charge counters on it.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Creek: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Auramancer enters the battlefield, you may return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Auratouched Mage enters the battlefield, search your library for an Aura card that could enchant it. If Auratouched Mage is still on the battlefield, put that Aura card onto the battlefield attached to it. Otherwise, reveal the Aura card and put it into your hand. Then shuffle.', 'When Beetleback Chief enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'When Brindle Shoat dies, create a 3/3 green Boar creature token.', "When Brutalizer Exarch enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.\\n• Put target noncreature permanent on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'When Mitotic Slime dies, create two 2/2 green Ooze creature tokens. They have "When this creature dies, create two 1/1 green Ooze creature tokens."', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Nest Invader enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Noggle Ransacker enters the battlefield, each player draws two cards, then discards a card at random.', 'When Ondu Giant enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Tukatongue Thallid dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'When Viridian Emissary dies, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Whirlpool Warrior enters the battlefield, shuffle the cards from your hand into your library, then draw that many cards.\\n{R}, Sacrifice Whirlpool Warrior: Each player shuffles the cards from their hand into their library, then draws that many cards.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, it deals damage equal to its power to any target.', 'Whenever a source an opponent controls deals damage to you, if Farsight Mask is untapped, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever an Aura becomes attached to Bramble Elemental, create two 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may have Hissing Iguanar deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', "{1}{U}{R}: Return Etherium-Horn Sorcerer to its owner's hand.\\nCascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)", '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}{G}, {T}: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{R}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Roll the planar die. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{T}: Return two target cards from an opponent's graveyard to their hand. Destroy target artifact or enchantment."]
flavor: ['"Artifice has always stood upon nature\'s shoulders. Let us watch nature take a turn."\\n—Freyalise', '"Choose one to heal, one to harm, and one to grant you the prudence to use them."\\n—Miotri, auratouched mage', '"Don\'t mistake my creations for mere vegetation. They are my children, loyal and fierce."', '"Don\'t try to hit your enemies. Concentrate on the space between them, and fill the air with doom."\\n—Spear-Tribe teaching', '"From in here, everything looks like dinner."', '"I don\'t concern myself with my enemy\'s hopes. Hopes follow the tides. They will retreat soon enough."\\n—Ambassador Laquatus', '"I welcome it. The pasture is cleared of weeds and the wolves are frozen solid."\\n—Lumi, goatherd', '"In memories, we can find our deepest reserves of strength."', '"It was a strange morning. When we awoke, we found our trees transformed. We didn\'t know whether to water them or polish them."\\n—Pulan, Bant orchardist', '"Kill the weak so they can\'t drag the strong down to their level. This is true compassion."\\n—Benzir, archdruid of Temple Might', '"Listen to the roar! Feel the thunder! The Immersturm shouts its approval with every bolt of lightning!"', '"May the memory of our fallen heroes ensnare the violent hearts of lesser men."\\n—Great Threshold of Monserkat inscription', '"Our unity unmasks your deceit."', '"The finest minions know what I need without me ever saying a thing."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"The treasure in my mind is greater than any worldly glory."', '"This is how wars are won—not with armies of soldiers but with a single knife blade, artfully placed."\\n—Yurin, royal assassin', '"This is the price of being last in the food chain. We must keep our places of beauty hidden away instead of displayed for all to see."\\n—Hildin, priest of Avacyn', '"This palace will be our fire-spit, and roasted prince our victory meal. Send in the torch-pigs!"\\n—Ghut Rak, Gruul guildmage', '"We thought the clouds had moved from the night sky. Then the night sky moved, and the horizon grew wings."\\n—Josuri', '"What say you, my most trusted advisors? . . . Advisors?"\\n—Edra, merfolk sovereign', '"What you are attempting is not against the law. It is, however, extremely foolish."', '"Yes, she is made of pure belief—but I hardly see why that makes her unique."\\n—Reith, master illusionist', 'A killing machine from birth.', 'A match for any army—even its own.', 'About halfway to the target, Snukk vowed that he had been tricked for the last time.', 'All seeds share a common bond, calling to each other across infinity.', 'Ancient lore locked in a mind driven mad is just as safe as when it was locked deep underground.', 'Animated by geists fused in its oak, it hungers for more life to add to its core.', 'As the shards merged into the Maelstrom, their mana energies fused into new monstrosities.', 'Each flower identical, every leaf and petal disturbingly exact.', 'He combs the streets looking for the lost light, the discarded enigmas of the city.', 'Hunters lure the stripling boar into the open, hoping to trap greater prey.', 'In abandoned corners of Ravnica, nature has begun to reclaim what it once owned.', 'In the autumn, she casts her seeds across the streets below, and come spring, her children rise in service to the Conclave.', 'It lingers near the outposts of the Makindi Trenches, inadvertently granting another layer of defense.', "It nurtures its masters' glorious future.", 'It turns the adversity of the moment into the knowledge of a lifetime.', 'Its beak rends flesh and bone, exposing the tender marrow of dream.', 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', "Jund's thallids tried to disguise their deliciousness by covering themselves in spines harvested from the tukatongue tree.", "Just when you thought you'd be safe, in the middle of an open field with no Eldrazi around for miles.", "Kill a gnarlid with your first blow, or it'll cheerfully show you how it's done.", "Krond, the personification of the dawn's light, lives to exact justice on his nemesis Vela.", "Nature doesn't walk.", 'Noggles live purely by what they can scavenge. There is not a single thing a noggle eats, wears, or uses that did not once belong to another.', "On Jund, everything eventually ends up in something else's stomach.", 'She reaches beyond the physical realm, touching the ideals from which all creatures draw their power.', 'Some druids nurture gardens. Others nurture continents.', 'Street folk call them "spire mice," but behind the mockery is an unspoken envy of the ledgewalkers\' skill at avoiding harm.', 'Such cloaks are in high demand both by assassins and by those who fear them.', 'Swarms thrive in its nest, feeding on leathery bits of discarded wing.', 'That the Tolarian mists parted for the drakes was warning enough to stay away.', 'The Boros legionnaire saw a noble sacrifice, the Rakdos thug a blazing suicide, and the Izzet alchemist an experiment gone awry.', 'The Sunbriar druids believe that every life begins in its heart and ends under its hooves.', 'The Thran learned to capture mana, but power inevitably escapes its bonds.', 'The flame of anger is hard to douse once lit.', 'The golems of the ancient Thran still draw power in ways that baffle the artificers of today.', "The ground erupted in time with the hedron's thrum, a dirge of the last days.", 'The mouth must be pried open before rigor mortis sets in. Otherwise the returning soul can find no ingress.', 'The murk of the Wanderbrine concealed unseemly rituals designed to bring out the worst in merrowkind.', 'The mysterious purpose of two of the rings had eluded Esper mages—until now.', 'The oil sloshes against his skull as he nears his destination: the Frogtosser Games and the lighting of the Flaming Boggart.', 'The passing of the sai presages the end of the old clan and the ascent of the new.', 'The shield of unimpeachable purity is as strong as any wrought on the anvil.', 'They could agree on one thing only: one of them must die.', 'Those who displease Oona soon learn the extent of the armies she commands.', 'Those who raged most bitterly at the world in life are cursed to roam the nether realms in death.', 'Tocasia brushed the gears and cogs from the table. There, before two wide-eyed brothers, she began a lesson on raw elemental magic.', "Vela snuffs out every trace of Krond's reign, leaving pure nightfall in her wake.", 'Viashino thrashes are led by elders who have survived countless challenges.', 'Viashino thrashes keep iguanars as hunting companions, giving them wounded captives as playthings.', 'When Asha left Bant, she ensured that the world would have protection and order in her absence.', 'When an order for griffin barding comes in, blacksmiths prepare their forges for months of exacting work. They know griffins always detect imperfections and never haggle.', 'When it snared a passing cockatrice, its own soul darkly doubled.', 'Whether trained, ridden, or eaten, few goblin military innovations have rivaled the bug.']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Allen Williams', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Ben Thompson', 'Bob Eggleton', 'Brad Rigney', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Gary Ruddell', 'Glen Angus', 'Heather Hudson', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Wong', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jean-Sébastien Rossbach', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jon Foster', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Luca Zontini', 'Marc Simonetti', 'Mark Brill', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Philip Straub', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Shishizaru', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Ellis', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tomas Giorello', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Val Mayerik', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
