rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If all your cards are lands, no damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t activate this ability unless a single opponent has at least two cards in their graveyard to target.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Each instance of each creature’s combat damage is counted separately. If three creatures with double strike attack you and all of them are unblocked, you may draw up to six cards.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Farsight Mask must be untapped both when the damage is dealt and when you would draw the card.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'This triggers each time a source an opponent controls deals damage to you. If the same source deals damage more than once in a turn, it triggers for each of those times.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You draw no more than one card each time a source an opponent controls damages you, no matter how much damage the source deals.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'If Higure deals first strike damage (or the first part of double strike damage), the triggered ability would resolve before regular combat damage, and the searched-for Ninja would be able to get swapped with an unblocked creature and still deal its regular damage.'}, {'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'If Higure deals regular combat damage and you use its ability to search for another Ninja, that card won’t be in your hand in time to activate its ninjutsu ability to put it onto the battlefield and deal damage. However, the card you searched for could still be swapped for an unblocked creature, including Higure, as long as you activate its ninjutsu ability before the end of combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'If the defending player has two or fewer cards in hand when Okiba-Gang Shinobi deals combat damage to that player, they are all discarded.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'If, during the combat damage step, a creature is destroyed during combat and Ink-Eyes also deals combat damage to a player, the destroyed creature can be a legal target for Ink-Eyes’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'Skullsnatcher’s ability can target zero, one, or two cards in that player’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Any Aura card you find must be able to enchant Auratouched Mage as it currently exists, or as it most recently existed on the battlefield if it’s no longer on the battlefield. If an effect has made the Mage an artifact, for example, you could search for an Aura with “enchant artifact.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "Creatures with reach (such as Giant Spider) don\'t actually have flying, so they can\'t block this."}]', "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose the “destroy” mode and Quiet Disrepair is moved to a different permanent while the ability is on the stack, the newly enchanted permanent will be destroyed when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose the “destroy” mode and Quiet Disrepair leaves the battlefield while the ability is on the stack, the last permanent it enchanted will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If either one of the creatures leaves the battlefield before Rivals’ Duel resolves, no damage is dealt to or by the remaining creature. If both creatures leave the battlefield before Rivals’ Duel resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve for having no legal targets.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If, by the time Rivals’ Duel resolves, an effect has caused the two target creatures to share a creature type, Rivals’ Duel doesn’t resolve for having no legal targets.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The two creatures may be controlled by the same player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "An “unblocked creature” is a creature that attacked and wasn\'t blocked. Creatures aren\'t “blocked” or “unblocked” until the declare blockers step, so activating this ability before then (or after combat ends) will have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Creatures stop being unblocked as the combat phase ends. However, they\'ll stay 4/1 until turn ends."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'If Inkfathom Witch is attacking and unblocked, it can make itself 4/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Inkfathom Witch doesn\'t cause creatures to lose their abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The effect from the ability overwrites other effects that set power and/or toughness if and only if those effects existed before the ability resolved. It will not overwrite effects that modify power or toughness (whether from a static ability, counters, or a resolved spell or ability), nor will it overwrite effects that set power and toughness which come into existence after the ability resolves. Effects that switch the creature\'s power and toughness are always applied after any other power or toughness changing effects, including this one, regardless of the order in which they are created."}]', "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The abilities are separate and cumulative. If another creature you control is both of the listed colors, it will get a total of +2/+2.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'First the player whose turn it is draws two cards, then each other player in turn order does so. Then the player whose turn it is randomly selects a card from their hand, then each other player in turn order does so. Finally, all cards selected this way are discarded at the same time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If multiple Quietus Spikes trigger at the same time, that player loses half their life when the first ability resolves, then loses half of the remainder when the next ability resolves, and so on. The player does not lose the same amount each time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "That player loses half their life after combat damage has been subtracted from the player\'s life total. The amount of life the player loses is determined as the triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, after combat damage is dealt, Quietus Spike looks at that player\'s life total (which is the same as the team\'s life total) when determining how much life the team will lose, which basically means the team\'s life total is halved. Here\'s an example of the math: The team has 19 life, so the player has 19 life. Quietus Spike causes the team to lose 10 life (19 divided by 2, rounded up). The team\'s life total becomes 9 (19 minus 10)."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The number of Saproling tokens created by the triggered ability is based on the number of +1/+1 counters on Mycoloth, not on the number of creatures Mycoloth devoured. It doesn’t matter where the +1/+1 counters came from.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being basic landcycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a basic landcycling ability from being activated.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with basic landcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Unlike the normal cycling ability, basic landcycling doesn’t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a basic land card. You don’t choose the type of basic land card you’ll find until you’re performing the search. After you choose a basic land card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You can choose not to find a basic land card, even if there is one in your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Hellkite Hatchling has flying and trample if at least one creature was sacrificed as a result of the Hatchling’s devour ability as it entered the battlefield. It retains those abilities even if its +1/+1 counters are somehow removed.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of Hellkite Hatchling (due to Mirrorweave, for example), the second ability checks to see whether that creature — not the original Hellkite Hatchling — devoured a creature as it entered the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "After Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability triggers, if Enigma Sphinx is removed from your graveyard in response, it won\'t be put into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If you control an Enigma Sphinx that\'s owned by another player, it\'s put into that player\'s graveyard from the battlefield, so Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If you have zero or one card left in your library when Enigma Sphinx\'s middle ability resolves, Enigma Sphinx is put on the bottom of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature’s ability is activated, that creature is the one that will deal and be dealt damage when the ability resolves. It doesn’t matter if Predatory Urge leaves the battlefield or somehow becomes attached to another creature by that time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature leaves the battlefield (or otherwise becomes an illegal target) before the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. The enchanted creature isn’t dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'On the other hand, if the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the ability continues to resolve. The enchanted creature deals damage to the targeted creature equal to the power the enchanted creature had as it last existed on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The controller of the enchanted creature may activate the ability, not the controller of Predatory Urge.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may have the enchanted creature target itself with its own ability. If you do, it will deal damage to itself equal to its power, then immediately do it again.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Overrun affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Aura Gnarlid\'s second ability counts each Aura regardless of who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The power of each potential blocking creature is checked against Aura Gnarlid\'s power only as blockers are declared. Once a creature blocks Aura Gnarlid, increasing the Gnarlid\'s power or decreasing the blocking creature\'s power won\'t undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast an Aura spell, Kor Spiritdancer\'s second ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The second ability triggers when you cast any Aura spell, not just one that targets Kor Spiritdancer.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Snake Umbra grants the triggered ability to the creature. It triggers whenever the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of its controller (who is not necessarily an opponent of the Aura\'s controller). In other words, if your Snake Umbra winds up enchanting your opponent\'s creature, that opponent will draw a card whenever that creature damages you."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time the totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Planar Cleansing) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. (This matters for cards such as Karmic Justice.) Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and the enchanted permanent has gained a regeneration shield. The next time it would be destroyed, you choose whether to apply the regeneration effect or the totem armor effect. The other effect is unused and remains, in case the permanent would be destroyed again.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Doom Blade). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Vendetta does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and that Aura has gained a regeneration shield. The next time the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, the Aura would be destroyed instead — but it regenerates, so nothing is destroyed at all. Alternately, if that Aura somehow gains indestructible, the enchanted permanent is effectively indestructible as well.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary permanent with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The card you shuffle into your library may be any card from your hand. It doesn’t have to be one of the cards you drew with the spell.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You have to shuffle a card from your hand into your library even if you don’t draw any cards (due to replacement effects or Maralen of the Mornsong’s ability, for example). If your hand is empty, you don’t shuffle your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield deals damage equal to its current power to the targeted permanent or player. If it\'s no longer on the battlefield, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Warstorm Surge is the source of the ability, but the creature is the source of the damage. The ability couldn\'t target a creature with protection from red, for example. It could target a creature with protection from creatures, but all the damage would be prevented. Since damage is dealt by the creature, abilities like lifelink, deathtouch and infect are taken into account, even if the creature has left the battlefield by the time it deals damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "Etherium-Horn Sorcerer\'s first ability can only be activated when it is on the battlefield. If Etherium-Horn Sorcerer isn\'t on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the ability won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. However, if you gain control of a creature enchanted by an Aura with totem armor and that creature would be destroyed that turn, instead the Aura will be destroyed and the creature will survive."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'Mass Mutiny can target untapped creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'The phrase "up to one" was inadvertently omitted from Mass Mutiny\\\'s rules text. The card has received errata to correct this.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Mass Mutiny even if an opponent doesn\'t control any creatures. You simply won\'t choose a target for that opponent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke or the alternative cost provided by the morph ability. If it has {X} in its mana cost, X must be 0. However, you can pay optional additional costs, such as kicker, and you must still pay mandatory additional costs, such as the one on Fling."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a permanent spell this way, it will enter the battlefield under your control when it resolves. If you cast an instant or sorcery spell this way, that card will be put into its owner\'s graveyard when it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'The nonland card you cast via the triggered ability is cast as part of the resolution of that ability. Timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type are ignored. Other restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during an opponent\\\'s turn," are not.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "In non-Planechase games, Fractured Powerstone\'s second ability will have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "Rolling the planar die this way doesn\'t count when determining the cost of the special action of rolling the planar die. For example, if you roll the planar die twice in a turn, then activate Fractured Powerstone to roll it a third time, rolling the planar die again that turn will cost {2}."}]', "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Sakashima’s Student enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature (like devour) will also work.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Because you return the unblocked attacking creature to its owner’s hand while activating the ninjutsu ability, you can’t have Sakashima’s Student enter the battlefield as a copy of that creature.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If Sakashima’s Student somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Sakashima’s Student can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is zero.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Sakashima’s Student copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Sakashima’s Student is not a token.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Sakashima’s Student), then your Sakashima’s Student enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Sakashima’s Student copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below) and it is a Ninja in addition to its other types. It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Sakashima’s Student enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Aura spells require a target when they are cast. Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability will affect Aura spells cast targeting it.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability can apply to any cost of a spell, including additional or alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Elderwood Scion’s cost-reduction ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of a spell.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'None of Elderwood Scion’s abilities affect abilities that target it.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Spells you cast that target Elderwood Scion will cost {2} less to cast even if those spells have additional targets. The same is true for spells your opponents cast costing {2} more.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Dreampod Druid’s ability checks to see if it’s enchanted at the beginning of each upkeep. If it’s not, the ability won’t trigger. If the ability triggers but Dreampod Druid isn’t enchanted when that ability resolves, the ability will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Notably, if Dreampod Druid leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, that ability will use Dreampod Druid’s last known information to determine whether or not it was enchanted. If it was enchanted when it left the battlefield, the ability will resolve and create a Saproling.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'For example, if Thromok devours one creature, it will enter the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it. If it devours two creatures, it will enter with two +1/+1 counters for each of them, for a total of four +1/+1 counters. Devouring three creatures will produce nine +1/+1 counters, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If Felidar Umbra is enchanting a creature with first strike, you can activate its ability and attach it to a creature without first strike during the first combat damage step. Each of those creatures will have lifelink when dealing combat damage and you’ll gain life accordingly.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'It’s not possible for Felidar Umbra to save two creatures that are being destroyed simultaneously.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If Krond isn’t enchanted when it’s declared as an attacking creature, the ability won’t trigger. If Krond isn’t enchanted when the ability resolves, the ability won’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If Vela leaves the battlefield at the same time as other creatures you control, its ability will trigger for each of those creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare blockers step, a creature is tapped or it’s affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. The creature doesn’t have to block.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Indrik Umbra does not give any creature the ability to block the enchanted creature. It just forces those creatures which are already able to block that creature to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'Preyseizer Dragon’s ability counts the number of +1/+1 counters on it when the ability resolves. It counts any +1/+1 counters, not just ones put on it due to devour.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability will resolve and the Insect will be created before the spell that caused it to trigger resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-06-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability won’t be affected if the spell that caused it to trigger is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature isn’t tapped during its controller’s next untap step (perhaps because it was untapped by a spell), Wall of Frost’s ability has no effect at that time. It won’t try to keep the creature tapped on subsequent turns.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Wall of Frost’s ability tracks the creature, not the creature’s controller. That is, if the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whether the other spell resolved. It could have been countered or, if you’ve somehow cast Illusory Angel as though it had flash, it could still be on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Mark of Mutiny can target any creature, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter remains on the creature after the control-changing effect ends.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Rancor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so it won\'t be put into a graveyard from the battlefield and its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If you choose not to attach Sai of the Shinobi to a creature that enters the battlefield, or if you can\'t (most likely because the creature has left the battlefield by the time the triggered ability resolves), Sai of the Shinobi doesn\'t move."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Akroma’s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Hissing Iguanar dies at the same time as another creature, Hissing Iguanar’s ability triggers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability to return Cage of Hands to its owner\'s hand can only be activated if Cage of Hands is on the battlefield. If Cage of Hands is no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, Cage of Hands remains in its new zone and isn\'t returned to its owner\'s hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each instance of cascade triggers and resolves separately. The spell you cast due to the first cascade ability will go on the stack on top of the second cascade ability. That spell will resolve before you exile cards for the second cascade ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Maelstrom Wanderer gives itself haste.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "No matter what spell you cast with the first cascade trigger (or with any cascade triggers that result from casting that spell), the second cascade trigger will look for a spell with mana value less than Maelstrom Wanderer\'s mana value of 8."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step in this case, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The creature put onto the battlefield with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won’t normally deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because it’s not on the battlefield yet, casting Sigil of the Empty Throne won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an object enters the battlefield as a copy of Primal Plasma, it copies the values determined by its enters-the-battlefield replacement effect, but its power and toughness are determined by the copy’s own enters-the-battlefield replacement effect. This can cause you to have a 3/3 creature with flying, or a 1/6 creature with flying and defender, for example.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an object on the battlefield becomes a copy of Primal Plasma, it copies the values determined by its enters-the-battlefield replacement effect.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'While not on the battlefield, Primal Plasma is a 0/0 creature card. It doesn’t have flying or defender.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was du versuchst, ist nicht gegen das Gesetz. Allerdings ist es äußerst dumm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e2333e-490f-4206-8c3b-4e5834a79cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 287907}, \'multiverseid\': 287907}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que intentas hacer no está contra la ley. Sin embargo, es muy tonto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b520e70-acd8-41af-9ae0-a17813ff9e09\', \'multiverseId\': 288063}, \'multiverseid\': 288063}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce que vous tentez n\'est pas interdit par la loi. Cependant, c\'est extrêmement stupide. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287751&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30eefe6c-9155-4295-938f-c75e23a4be90\', \'multiverseId\': 287751}, \'multiverseid\': 287751}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quello che stai tentando non è contro la legge. Però, è decisamente sciocco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475932ab-0a65-46af-9742-b2ffefc83baf\', \'multiverseId\': 288219}, \'multiverseid\': 288219}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前のやりたいことが法に逆らってるってことじゃない。 ただ、ものすごく馬鹿げてるってだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf07052-917e-44cc-afa1-a78bd5716d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 288375}, \'multiverseid\': 288375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Advokat des Annullierens\', \'text\': \'{T}: Bringe zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners auf seine Hand zurück. Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Einigkeit deckt eure Falschheit auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc4520a-5d8b-44b2-bdff-188defc0e8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 287912}, \'multiverseid\': 287912}, {\'name\': \'Defensor magoanula\', \'text\': \'{T}: Regresa dos cartas objetivo del cementerio de un oponente a su mano. Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestra unidad desenmascara su engaño."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63ca511-966d-4f6b-94d6-644da5ddcd7a\', \'multiverseId\': 288068}, \'multiverseid\': 288068}, {\'name\': \'Partisan des annulmages\', \'text\': "{T} : Renvoyez dans sa main deux cartes ciblées du cimetière d\'un adversaire. Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Notre unité démasque leur tromperie. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc9da39-78e1-41b8-96a6-5e02673f9afd\', \'multiverseId\': 287756}, \'multiverseid\': 287756}, {\'name\': \'Difensore di Magivuoto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Fai tornare in mano a un avversario due carte bersaglio dal suo cimitero. Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"La nostra unione smaschera gli inganni."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bdac276-8079-4652-aa86-8f78f89aeda6\', \'multiverseId\': 288224}, \'multiverseid\': 288224}, {\'name\': \'虚無魔道士の代言者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人の墓地にあるカード２枚を対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。 アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの結束はおまえの偽りを暴き出す。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b088292-d9b1-4eb7-94d3-50398525ebc8\', \'multiverseId\': 288380}, \'multiverseid\': 288380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführer der Käferreiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Anführer der Käferreiter ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie richten sie ab, reiten auf ihnen und essen sie hinterher: Nur wenige andere militärische Erfindungen der Goblins können mit den Käfern mithalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7d1e15-dc9f-4676-bad4-39dc85c9a1fb\', \'multiverseId\': 287851}, \'multiverseid\': 287851}, {\'name\': \'Jefe lomo de escarabajo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Jefe lomo de escarabajo entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Ya sea entrenados, domados o cenados, pocas innovaciones militares de los trasgos eran mejores que los bichos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7091922d-63de-45a1-ba2a-52b86dc607a6\', \'multiverseId\': 288007}, \'multiverseid\': 288007}, {\'name\': \'Chef Scarapace\', \'text\': \'Quand le Chef Scarapace arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'il soit dressé, chevauché ou mangé, nulle innovation gobeline pourrait rivaliser avec le cancrelat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287695&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1cc1040-44cd-46a6-870c-2a06189fc1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 287695}, \'multiverseid\': 287695}, {\'name\': \'Capo Cavalcascarabei\', \'text\': \'Quando il Capo Cavalcascarabei entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Che sia addestrato, cavalcato o mangiato, ben poche innovazioni militari dei goblin hanno eguagliato l\'insetto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bbbd7f4-3e6b-4287-ad1e-2193ccd66eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 288163}, \'multiverseid\': 288163}, {\'name\': \'甲虫背の酋長\', \'text\': \'甲虫背の酋長が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン･クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'訓練されようが、乗られようが、食われようが、虫ほど画期的なゴブリンの軍事革新はほとんど無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d492d3e9-4fa2-4d1a-96ac-896227e69de6\', \'multiverseId\': 288319}, \'multiverseid\': 288319}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellender Kriegssturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Lausche dem Grollen! Spüre den Donner! Der Immersturm brüllt mit jedem Blitz seine Zustimmung heraus!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c734c853-acbd-4de9-b514-b5602449f7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 287954}, \'multiverseid\': 287954}, {\'name\': \'Oleada de tormenta de guerra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, le hace daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Escuchen el rugido! ¡Sientan el trueno! ¡Immersturm grita su aprobación con cada relámpago!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6260591-1568-49e8-87bb-ac663e4a2263\', \'multiverseId\': 288110}, \'multiverseid\': 288110}, {\'name\': "Déferlement de l\'orage de guerre", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, elle inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Écoutez son grondement ! Ressentez son tonnerre ! L\'Immersturm crie son approbation avec chacun de ses éclairs ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde06830-a3f2-46c3-986e-ef68c969df5a\', \'multiverseId\': 287798}, \'multiverseid\': 287798}, {\'name\': \'Scarica di Guerratempesta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ascoltate il rombo! Sentite il tuono! L\\\'Immersturm urla la sua approvazione con ogni fulmine!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36ebb4a-ecd3-40e6-a160-18fd39e7f2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 288266}, \'multiverseid\': 288266}, {\'name\': \'戦嵐のうねり\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その戦場に出たクリーチャーは、そのクリーチャーやプレイヤーに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「この叫びを聞け！ 雷を感じよ！ イマースタームは稲妻で応え叫んでいるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62887073-c8f4-4d46-8196-d9742af45dff\', \'multiverseId\': 288422}, \'multiverseid\': 288422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armillarsphäre\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Armillarsphäre: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardländern, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der geheimnisvolle Zweck von zwei der Ringe war den Magiern von Esper entgangen — bis jetzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada759b6-08bd-4119-b0bb-20aeb57ebf33\', \'multiverseId\': 287874}, \'multiverseid\': 287874}, {\'name\': \'Esfera armilar\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Esfera armilar: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas y ponlas en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El misterioso propósito de dos de los anillos eludió a los magos de Esper... hasta hoy.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dfa9293-c97c-4dca-94b7-f6dce09d8b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 288030}, \'multiverseid\': 288030}, {\'name\': \'Sphère armillaire\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Sphère armillaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez-les et mettez-les dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'objectif mystérieux de deux des anneaux avait échappé aux mages d\'Esper — du moins jusqu\'à présent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287718&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6c0f60-b12e-4ef3-954b-3ea2adca38a8\', \'multiverseId\': 287718}, \'multiverseid\': 287718}, {\'name\': \'Astrolabio Sferico\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Astrolabio Sferico: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Lo scopo di due di quegli anelli era ancora sconosciuto ai maghi di Esper. Fino ad oggi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ddaf240-250d-41a4-8873-6663e6290754\', \'multiverseId\': 288186}, \'multiverseid\': 288186}, {\'name\': \'天球儀\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 天球儀を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを最大２枚まで探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'エスパーの魔道士には、謎の二つの輪の目的が分からないままだった――これまでは。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a3ba537-6d8f-40c1-99ec-f5cbcadc82ea\', \'multiverseId\': 288342}, \'multiverseid\': 288342}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aura-Knurrer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, deren Stärke niedriger ist als die des Aura-Knurrers, können ihn nicht blocken.\\nDer Aura-Knurrer erhält +1/+1 für jede Aura im Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du einen Knurrer nicht mit dem ersten Schlag tötest, zeigt er dir begierig, wie man es macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1abaa186-3f3d-4c90-a6fa-7a36cb4e2994\', \'multiverseId\': 287884}, \'multiverseid\': 287884}, {\'name\': \'Gnárlido de aura\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza menor que el Gnárlido de aura no pueden bloquearlo.\\nEl Gnárlido de aura obtiene +1/+1 por cada aura en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Si no acabas con un gnárlido con tu primer golpe, él te enseñará gustoso cómo se hace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ffe6e71-9055-49d6-bdef-fabff4c36e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 288040}, \'multiverseid\': 288040}, {\'name\': "Gnarlide d\'aura", \'text\': "Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Gnarlide d\'aura ne peuvent pas le bloquer.\\nLe Gnarlide d\'aura gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Il faut tuer un gnarlide du premier coup ou il se fera un plaisir de vous montrer comment s\'y prendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22121dc7-02f8-481b-8c2c-1af98e747379\', \'multiverseId\': 287728}, \'multiverseid\': 287728}, {\'name\': "Gnarlid dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Le creature con forza inferiore a quella del Gnarlid dell\'Aura non possono bloccarlo.\\nIl Gnarlid dell\'Aura prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Uccidi un gnarlid al primo colpo o ti mostrerà volentieri come si fa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'451cea8f-9ef8-45e6-9164-36d57b0438a0\', \'multiverseId\': 288196}, \'multiverseid\': 288196}, {\'name\': \'オーラのナーリッド\', \'text\': \'オーラのナーリッドよりもパワーの小さいクリーチャーは、それをブロックできない。\\nオーラのナーリッドは、戦場に出ているオーラ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ナーリッドを殺すなら一撃で仕留めろ。さもなくば、そいつは喜んでその効き目を教えてくれるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5dfc7a3-2a4f-463f-a75f-8e2ff3a91f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 288352}, \'multiverseid\': 288352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraschöpfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Auraschöpfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„In unseren Erinnerungen finden wir die besten Stärkereserven."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc68a47-7aeb-4af0-9c77-3f6626112175\', \'multiverseId\': 287906}, \'multiverseid\': 287906}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Auramante entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En nuestros recuerdos podemos encontrar nuestras mejores reservas de fuerza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcbebb1d-d819-4083-973d-1a52c16be6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 288062}, \'multiverseid\': 288062}, {\'name\': \'Auramancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auramancienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est dans les souvenirs que nous trouvons nos réserves de force les plus profondes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3654f9ae-03c9-4381-9304-bb098f2bfcc7\', \'multiverseId\': 287750}, \'multiverseid\': 287750}, {\'name\': \'Animago\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Animago entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nei ricordi, possiamo trovare le nostre più profonde riserve di forze."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3723e67-ed4f-4b2d-b3a2-5a842bec5a63\', \'multiverseId\': 288218}, \'multiverseid\': 288218}, {\'name\': \'オーラ術師\', \'text\': \'オーラ術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは、それをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「最も深くに蓄えられている力は、記憶の中にあります。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b185711-bbc8-4d22-8db5-07453d7a1b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 288374}, \'multiverseid\': 288374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraumwobener Magier\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Auraumwobene Magier ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Aurakarte, die ihn verzaubern könnte. Falls der Auraumwobene Magier immer noch im Spiel ist, bringe diese Aurakarte an ihn angelegt ins Spiel. Zeige sonst die Aurakarte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8f7933-37d3-4003-bf07-19a3a8f3c7f9\', \'multiverseId\': 287937}, \'multiverseid\': 287937}, {\'name\': \'Mago auraencantado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mago auraencantado entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de aura que pueda encantarlo. Si el Mago auraencantado sigue en el campo de batalla, pon esa carta de aura en el campo de batalla anexada a él. De lo contrario, muestra la carta de aura y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26f66c0-c21c-4144-9f28-bafb13ac99be\', \'multiverseId\': 288093}, \'multiverseid\': 288093}, {\'name\': \'Mage auraltéré\', \'text\': "Quand le Mage auraltéré arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'aura qui pourrait l\'enchanter. Si le Mage auraltéré est toujours sur le champ de bataille, mettez cette carte d\'aura sur le champ de bataille, attachée au Mage auraltéré. Sinon, révélez la carte d\'aura et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279bc664-b47f-4d19-973b-5dcf88e793d1\', \'multiverseId\': 287781}, \'multiverseid\': 287781}, {\'name\': \'Mago Aurotinto\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mago Aurotinto entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Aura che possa incantarlo. Se il Mago Aurotinto è ancora sul campo di battaglia, metti quella carta Aura sul campo di battaglia a lui assegnata. Altrimenti, rivela la carta Aura e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e02543-bb35-44af-9701-cbdf9637238b\', \'multiverseId\': 288249}, \'multiverseid\': 288249}, {\'name\': \'オーラ掠りの魔道士\', \'text\': \'オーラ掠りの魔道士が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーからそれにエンチャントできるオーラ・カードを１枚探す。 オーラ掠りの魔道士が戦場に残っている場合、そのオーラ・カードを、それにつけた状態で戦場に出す。 そうでない場合、そのオーラ・カードを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1d1f5a-5dc8-4cfa-9bf2-727313713dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 288405}, \'multiverseid\': 288405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbruch der Teufelsbraten\', \'text\': \'Opfere alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, und bringe dann ebenso viele 4/4 rote Teufelsbraten-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Glaube nie, dass du in Sicherheit bist, auch nicht allein auf weiter Flur, meilenweit von den nächsten Eldrazi entfernt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363b5ec4-3707-4f50-9be7-e432008a6aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 287894}, \'multiverseid\': 287894}, {\'name\': \'Erupción de infernales\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica todas las criaturas que controlas, luego pon en el campo de batalla esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Infernal rojas 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Justo cuando creías que estabas a salvo, en el medio de un campo abierto, sin eldrazi en kilómetros a la redonda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fcedf97-b5a4-40ba-a64b-9def2dd7f971\', \'multiverseId\': 288050}, \'multiverseid\': 288050}, {\'name\': \'Éruption de monstruosités\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille autant de jetons de créature 4/4 rouge Monstruosité.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Juste au moment où vous pensiez être en sécurité, au beau milieu d\'un champ et sans un Eldrazi à moins d\'une lieue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773f9d1a-300c-4ece-9f98-f9a6d80e8838\', \'multiverseId\': 287738}, \'multiverseid\': 287738}, {\'name\': \'Eruzione di Infernali\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica tutte le creature che controlli, poi metti sul campo di battaglia altrettante pedine creatura Infernale 4/4 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Proprio quando pensavi di essere al sicuro, nel bel mezzo di un campo senza neanche un Eldrazi in vista per chilometri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4d966b-fc4b-427b-91f1-97006a6e4f36\', \'multiverseId\': 288206}, \'multiverseid\': 288206}, {\'name\': \'乱暴者の噴火\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げ、その後その数に等しい数の赤の４/４のヘリオン・クリーチャー・トークンを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'周囲数マイルにエルドラージの全くいない平原の真ん中で、ここなら安心と思ったその瞬間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bd511b-b1bd-4456-b795-64d6dc17081d\', \'multiverseId\': 288362}, \'multiverseid\': 288362}]', "[{'name': 'Beutegreiferdrache', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nVerschlingen 2 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit doppelt so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nWenn der Beutegreiferdrache angreift, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie +1/+1-Marken auf dem Beutegreiferdrachen liegen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287852&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b144b1b8-b3c0-4965-86c0-0ffb37928b2b', 'multiverseId': 287852}, 'multiverseid': 287852}, {'name': 'Dragón capturapresas', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nDevorar 2. (En cuanto esto entra al campo de batalla puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con el doble esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que el Dragón capturapresas ataque, le hace daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo igual al número de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Dragón capturapresas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288008&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50b6967c-361b-43c8-9d4e-42045c392a54', 'multiverseId': 288008}, 'multiverseid': 288008}, {'name': 'Dragon priseproie', 'text': 'Vol\\nDévorement 2 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier le nombre de créatures de votre choix. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon priseproie attaque, il inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Dragon priseproie.', 'type': 'Créature : dragon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287696&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e567134-29dd-4239-9dc0-b88fb466b5f1', 'multiverseId': 287696}, 'multiverseid': 287696}, {'name': 'Drago Afferraprede', 'text': 'Volare\\nDivorare 2 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Entra nel campo di battaglia con il doppio di segnalini +1/+1.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Drago Afferraprede attacca, infligge a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio danno pari al numero di segnalini +1/+1 sul Drago Afferraprede.', 'type': 'Creatura — Drago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288164&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87d26c43-20d8-4d2b-845d-21a8dfb3832e', 'multiverseId': 288164}, 'multiverseid': 288164}, {'name': '餌食奪いのドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n貪食 ２ （これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。 このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の２倍に等しい＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\n餌食奪いのドラゴンが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。餌食奪いのドラゴンはそれに、餌食奪いのドラゴンの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288320&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb7dbad0-0933-4494-b32f-adeb7fef6f6d', 'multiverseId': 288320}, 'multiverseid': 288320}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutzopf-Elf\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c519efd0-056f-4d03-9138-0c47170a8cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 287902}, \'multiverseid\': 287902}, {\'name\': \'Elfo trenzas sangrientas\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c72ac9e-61bb-4181-a0a6-e128b5201d67\', \'multiverseId\': 288058}, \'multiverseid\': 288058}, {\'name\': \'Elfe aux Nattes sanguinolentes\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168ac42b-2997-49de-9d19-a58c687be54a\', \'multiverseId\': 287746}, \'multiverseid\': 287746}, {\'name\': \'Elfa dalle Trecce Rosse\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ccd0b82-f667-4bbb-a078-0fa776bb43a4\', \'multiverseId\': 288214}, \'multiverseid\': 288214}, {\'name\': \'血編み髪のエルフ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520154c1-1bff-4234-aad0-c65fa736fbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 288370}, \'multiverseid\': 288370}]', "[{'name': 'Blütenmauer', 'text': 'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Blütenmauer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pflanze, Mauer', 'flavor': 'Jede Blüte war identisch, jeder Zweig, jedes Blatt fast störend exakt gleich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287972&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20ee08d1-cacd-420c-9fbf-ea96651a6d7e', 'multiverseId': 287972}, 'multiverseid': 287972}, {'name': 'Muro de flores', 'text': 'Defensor\\nCuando el Muro de flores entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Muro planta', 'flavor': 'Cada flor idéntica, cada hoja y pétalo perturbadoramente exacto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288128&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a24d2446-29b5-4846-9ed2-5261bb72911f', 'multiverseId': 288128}, 'multiverseid': 288128}, {'name': 'Mur de fleurs', 'text': 'Défenseur\\nQuand le Mur de fleurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : plante et mur', 'flavor': 'Les fleurs sont toutes identiques, avec une troublante exactitude. Chaque feuille, chaque pétale !', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287816&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1ecd7fb-bf4c-4601-b67b-425b603ab0ff', 'multiverseId': 287816}, 'multiverseid': 287816}, {'name': 'Muro di Bocciuoli', 'text': 'Difensore\\nQuando il Muro di Bocciuoli entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Muro Pianta', 'flavor': 'Ogni fiore identico a se stesso, ogni foglia e petalo uguali in modo inquietante.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288284&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '119ddc59-1115-4ea2-bc29-53f63aa7f5f2', 'multiverseId': 288284}, 'multiverseid': 288284}, {'name': '花の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n花の壁が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・壁', 'flavor': '花の一つ一つが全く同じだ。葉の一枚一枚、花びらの一枚一枚が、気味悪いほど同じなのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288440&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76bb060f-8f8d-4c42-8809-247367f40c79', 'multiverseId': 288440}, 'multiverseid': 288440}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brombeerstrauchelementar\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Aura an das Brombeerstrauchelementar angelegt wird oder angelegt an das Brombeerstrauchelementar ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'An aufgegebenen Ecken von Ravnica hat die Natur damit angefangen, das zurückzuerobern, was ihr einst gehörte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e3bee6-122e-4c99-bcb5-b0673c4c61f4\', \'multiverseId\': 287938}, \'multiverseid\': 287938}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de zarzas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un aura sea anexada al Elemental de zarzas o entre al campo de batalla anexada al Elemental de zarzas, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Saprolín verdes 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'En algunos rincones abandonados de Rávnica, la naturaleza ha comenzado a reclamar lo que alguna vez fue suyo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8294da-c717-4738-b50f-b346d1502d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 288094}, \'multiverseid\': 288094}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de ronces\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une aura devient attachée à l\'Élémental de ronces ou qu\'elle arrive sur le champ de bataille attachée à l\'Élémental de ronces, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Dans les recoins abandonnés de Ravnica, la nature a commencé à reprendre ses droits.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97b6f93-6c1f-4dc7-b4f9-cabdab1ff36c\', \'multiverseId\': 287782}, \'multiverseid\': 287782}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Rovi\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'Aura viene assegnata all\'Elementale dei Rovi o entra nel campo di battaglia assegnata all\'Elementale dei Rovi, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Nei recessi abbandonati di Ravnica, la natura ha cominciato a reclamare ciò che un tempo le apparteneva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7721eef-d61e-415c-a73c-77d97defc021\', \'multiverseId\': 288250}, \'multiverseid\': 288250}, {\'name\': \'棘茨の精霊\', \'text\': \'オーラが１つ棘茨の精霊につけられるか、オーラが１つ棘茨の精霊につけられた状態で戦場に出るたび、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカの見捨てられた街角では、自然はかつて自分の物であったことを示し始めている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445db1ef-3f25-4ae2-99b3-7f05f19fcfc7\', \'multiverseId\': 288406}, \'multiverseid\': 288406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Darüber hinaus sehen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und mische dann eine Karte aus deiner Hand in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Uraltes Wissen, das in einem verrückt gewordenen Gehirn verborgen ist, ist dort genauso sicher, als ob es tief in der Erde eingegraben wäre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b5f355c-7324-4b11-b565-ee05e57c2ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 287890}, \'multiverseid\': 287890}, {\'name\': \'Ver más allá\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego baraja una carta de tu mano en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los antiguos secretos escondidos en una mente delirante están tan seguros como cuando estaban enterrados profundamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb015f60-41c8-4de7-a519-a5841a831eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 288046}, \'multiverseid\': 288046}, {\'name\': \'Voir plus loin\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes, puis mélangez une carte de votre main à votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une connaissance ancienne verrouillée dans un esprit dément est tout autant en sécurité que si elle avait été profondément ensevelie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b86c51-1aa0-45cb-a1cc-d201958019e6\', \'multiverseId\': 287734}, \'multiverseid\': 287734}, {\'name\': \'Vedere Oltre\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, poi rimescola una carta dalla tua mano nel tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'antico sapere chiuso in una mente impazzita è al sicuro come se fosse sepolto nelle profondità della terra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188241d3-dbcc-40fc-a43c-14e06de88a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 288202}, \'multiverseid\': 288202}, {\'name\': \'先読み\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引き、その後あなたの手札にあるカードを１枚あなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'狂気の中に閉じ込められた古代の知識は、地底深くに閉じ込められたのと同じぐらい安全だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'601b7b6d-c33c-4054-8a7a-182a99774856\', \'multiverseId\': 288358}, \'multiverseid\': 288358}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Deren Beherrscher bringt einen 3/3 grünen Bestien-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Tötet die Schwachen, damit sie die Starken nicht auf ihre Stufe hinunterziehen können. Das ist wahres Mitgefühl." —Benzir, Erzdruide des Macht-Tempels\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b45ddf3-4da9-4560-8a13-fe938b24e72b\', \'multiverseId\': 287965}, \'multiverseid\': 287965}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador pone en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Maten a los débiles para que no arrastren a los fuertes a su nivel. Eso es verdadera compasión." —Benzir, archidruida del Templo del Poder\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd12f780-14c1-4e83-99a5-0b8adb5a2388\', \'multiverseId\': 288121}, \'multiverseid\': 288121}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur met sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Tuer les faibles pour éviter qu\'ils n\'entraînent les plus forts dans leur chute. C\'est ça, la véritable compassion. » —Benzir, archidruide du Temple de la Prépotence", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f2ee68-990d-4567-b9a0-f310c217d6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 287809}, \'multiverseid\': 287809}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore mette sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uccidere i deboli così che non possano trascinare i forti al loro livello. Questa è la vera compassione." —Benzir, arcidruido del Tempio Possente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4dd74f0-35f6-4978-93a0-88d14cc6dd79\', \'multiverseId\': 288277}, \'multiverseid\': 288277}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。 それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「弱き者を殺せ。強き者をその域に落とさせぬために。 これぞ真の慈悲だ。」 ――力の寺院の大ドルイド、ベンジア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efeb9b05-ca37-42e0-832c-cf5eea7af1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 288433}, \'multiverseid\': 288433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f692833-4f26-4f62-84b6-4da572360243\', \'multiverseId\': 287939}, \'multiverseid\': 287939}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto Dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controles a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f340f99-cc4b-4afc-9d09-b2d4eaf26521\', \'multiverseId\': 288095}, \'multiverseid\': 288095}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c813075-cee0-4238-8128-de11f41f97fd\', \'multiverseId\': 287783}, \'multiverseid\': 287783}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b7001e-696e-454f-bc33-2055658bba81\', \'multiverseId\': 288251}, \'multiverseid\': 288251}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地を１つオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17019e54-b472-4d1c-bbe2-16fc5f321f00\', \'multiverseId\': 288407}, \'multiverseid\': 288407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Infiltrator\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Infiltrator ist unblockbar.\\nTransmutation {1}{U}{B} ({1}{U}{B}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte mit den gleichen umgewandelten Manakosten wie diese Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek. Spiele Transmutation nur wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e795ce-15d7-4686-aeba-fb371e2bb4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 287944}, \'multiverseid\': 287944}, {\'name\': \'Espía Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Espía Dimir es imbloqueable.\\nTransmutar {1}{U}{B}. ({1}{U}{B}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta con el mismo coste de maná convertido que esta carta, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca. Transmuta sólo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78366616-d255-44f2-ac0c-8db3e81b6b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 288100}, \'multiverseid\': 288100}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrateur dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrateur dimir est imblocable.\\nTransmutation {1}{U}{B} ({1}{U}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte ayant le même coût converti de mana que cette carte, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Ne transmutez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287788&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b51cd14-65fe-4dd5-98bf-3bbd18533acb\', \'multiverseId\': 287788}, \'multiverseid\': 287788}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrato Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrato Dimir non può essere bloccato.\\nTrasmutare {1}{U}{B} ({1}{U}{B}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta con lo stesso costo di mana convertito di questa carta, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Trasmuta solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85b7d8e2-9b81-4ec7-b006-d284a7a8d47f\', \'multiverseId\': 288256}, \'multiverseid\': 288256}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの浸透者\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの浸透者はブロックされない。\\n変成 {1}{U}{B} （{1}{U}{B}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーからこのカードと同じ点数で見たマナ・コストを持つカードを１枚探し、公開して手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。 変成はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78566647-00ea-437d-b428-ea9a98a6855c\', \'multiverseId\': 288412}, \'multiverseid\': 288412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenhortspinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ganze Schwärme leben in seinem Nest und ernähren sich von den ledrigen Stückchen der abgestoßenen Flügelschuppen..\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a7975c-6b0b-4a93-8e6a-45eb0f60b69c\', \'multiverseId\': 287860}, \'multiverseid\': 287860}, {\'name\': \'Araña del cubil del dragón\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'En su nido prosperan los enjambres, alimentándose de pedazos escamosos de restos de alas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a37ed0e-5f0d-4634-a604-9f088eb08485\', \'multiverseId\': 288016}, \'multiverseid\': 288016}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de la tanière du dragon\', \'text\': "Portée\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Les essaims prospèrent dans son nid en se nourrissant des vestiges de cuir d\'une aile abandonnée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287704&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5abedd-dc7a-4ae5-a2bd-f3662812af74\', \'multiverseId\': 287704}, \'multiverseid\': 287704}, {\'name\': \'Ragna Tana di Drago\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Gli sciami prosperano nel suo nido, nutrendosi di coriacei pezzetti di ali staccate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787f72e7-45ec-4bd0-b1ea-3425023d2d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 288172}, \'multiverseid\': 288172}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの巣の蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達\\nいずれかの対戦相手が呪文を１つ唱えるたび、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'群れは巣で成長し、捨てられた翼の皮の欠片を餌とする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0989cecb-a2e6-4484-9b33-1b26283bffb8\', \'multiverseId\': 288328}, \'multiverseid\': 288328}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drang der Raubtiere\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Jene Kreatur fügt dieser Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6145ba4f-a18d-4c72-acaa-234d087d2f36\', \'multiverseId\': 287873}, \'multiverseid\': 287873}, {\'name\': \'Impulso depredador\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene "{T}: Esta criatura hace daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a esta criatura".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53c20357-86e6-4332-b5c9-be5676c60e89\', \'multiverseId\': 288029}, \'multiverseid\': 288029}, {\'name\': \'Pulsion prédatoire\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a « {T} : Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à la créature ciblée. Celle-ci inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à la première créature. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf1dff9-0e00-49b9-96a0-c496a6dcb531\', \'multiverseId\': 287717}, \'multiverseid\': 287717}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Predatorio\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{T}: Questa creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a questa creatura".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8648f654-9d9e-420a-8d0f-f13acf43be91\', \'multiverseId\': 288185}, \'multiverseid\': 288185}, {\'name\': \'捕食者の衝動\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは「{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。 そのクリーチャーはこのクリーチャーに、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0dd872-fceb-434f-96b4-0ddc44acee31\', \'multiverseId\': 288341}, \'multiverseid\': 288341}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drei Träume\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Aurakarten mit unterschiedlichen Namen, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wähle einen der Heilung, einen des Verletzens und einen, der dir die Besonnenheit gewährt, sie richtig anzuwenden." —Miotri, Auraumwobener Magier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96384ce-e4b2-4fb1-ad12-c7750b7b18bd\', \'multiverseId\': 287970}, \'multiverseid\': 287970}, {\'name\': \'Tres sueños\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de aura con nombres distintos, muéstralas y ponlas en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Elige uno para curar, uno para lastimar y uno para darte la prudencia a la hora de usarlos." —Miotri, maga auraencantada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28201f2-1576-491d-9b6e-0b36d3c6fa5a\', \'multiverseId\': 288126}, \'multiverseid\': 288126}, {\'name\': \'Trois rêves\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes d\'aura ayant des noms différents, révélez-les et mettez-les dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Choisissez-en un qui soigne, un qui blesse, et le troisième pour vous donner la prudence nécessaire pour les utiliser. » —Miotri, mage auraltérée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba266277-25a8-4775-ac55-686b4bd76261\', \'multiverseId\': 287814}, \'multiverseid\': 287814}, {\'name\': \'Tre Sogni\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte Aura con nomi diversi, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Scegline uno per guarire, uno per ferire e uno per donarti la prudenza necessaria a utilizzarli." —Miotri, maga aurotinta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3972faa5-e71a-49ab-b39b-d80c179b4561\', \'multiverseId\': 288282}, \'multiverseid\': 288282}, {\'name\': \'三つの夢\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから互いに異なる名前のオーラ・カードを最大３枚まで探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「癒すもの、害するもの、そしてそれらを使う分別を与えるものを選べ。」 ――オーラ掠りの魔道士、ミオートリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b66626-935c-41a1-a04a-8715f73d401f\', \'multiverseId\': 288438}, \'multiverseid\': 288438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Duell der Rivalen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die keinen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam haben. Diese Kreaturen kämpfen miteinander. (Jede dieser Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie konnten sich nur auf eines einigen: Einer von ihnen beiden musste sterben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'198377b0-b054-471f-84fc-9af155a96061\', \'multiverseId\': 287931}, \'multiverseid\': 287931}, {\'name\': \'Duelo de rivales\', \'text\': \'Elige dos criaturas objetivo que no compartan tipos de criatura. Esas criaturas luchan entre sí. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Sólo estaban de acuerdo en una cosa: uno debía morir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3924ac2a-546c-4f12-a1c9-d095977106a2\', \'multiverseId\': 288087}, \'multiverseid\': 288087}, {\'name\': \'Duel entre rivaux\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux créatures ciblées qui ne partagent pas de type de créature. Ces créatures se battent l\'une contre l\'autre. (Chaque créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ils n\'étaient d\'accord que sur un point : l\'un d\'eux devait mourir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e1dd3c1-f12b-4258-9c9e-873f58272927\', \'multiverseId\': 287775}, \'multiverseid\': 287775}, {\'name\': \'Duello dei Rivali\', \'text\': "Scegli due creature bersaglio che non condividono alcun tipo di creatura. Quelle creature lottano l\'una con l\'altra. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Sono d\'accordo su una sola cosa: uno di loro deve morire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2026177-b43b-4dee-964f-30298139658e\', \'multiverseId\': 288243}, \'multiverseid\': 288243}, {\'name\': \'ライバル同士の一騎打ち\', \'text\': \'共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持たないクリーチャー２体を対象とする。 それらのクリーチャーは互いに格闘を行う。 （それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼らが同意することは一つだけ。どちらかが死なねばならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1c45b3-1bfb-408c-897c-f3175515936d\', \'multiverseId\': 288399}, \'multiverseid\': 288399}]', "[{'name': 'Dunkle Brut', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn die Dunkle Brut ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schrecken', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287947&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70ad3281-80f4-4bc6-837f-d9b4d95b8c04', 'multiverseId': 287947}, 'multiverseid': 287947}, {'name': 'Cría siniestra', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando la Cría siniestra entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra. No puede ser regenerada.', 'type': 'Criatura — Horror', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288103&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28b61a9c-c9a4-44f2-9a95-2653193dc97e', 'multiverseId': 288103}, 'multiverseid': 288103}, {'name': 'Couvée ténébreuse', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand la Couvée ténébreuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez la créature non-noire ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.', 'type': 'Créature : horreur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287791&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5aefa4c1-8482-450a-ad5d-b0ba5834e8c5', 'multiverseId': 287791}, 'multiverseid': 287791}, {'name': 'Cucciolo Oscuro', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Cucciolo Oscuro entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura non nera bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerata.', 'type': 'Creatura — Orrore', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288259&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41016b3b-c4a5-41bf-90da-a62ba5653c40', 'multiverseId': 288259}, 'multiverseid': 288259}, {'name': '暗黒の雛', 'text': '飛行\\n暗黒の雛が戦場に出たとき、黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。 それは再生できない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホラー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288415&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa2a04de-3789-4367-afb1-8a24b0c968d1', 'multiverseId': 288415}, 'multiverseid': 288415}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '573eb3c0-73d7-4755-b919-dd7a7036bf6d', 'multiverseId': 287987}, 'multiverseid': 287987}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288143&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0fbc665-8112-4a78-b8c6-2eb0ecafaa0c', 'multiverseId': 288143}, 'multiverseid': 288143}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287831&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ce15653-5aee-4853-b29b-d57db38f2f3e', 'multiverseId': 287831}, 'multiverseid': 287831}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288299&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84abd794-5977-4f75-b62a-39acf7e4f012', 'multiverseId': 288299}, 'multiverseid': 288299}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288455&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '542841c8-a6b4-46cc-b19e-9d085fdb2f43', 'multiverseId': 288455}, 'multiverseid': 288455}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287988&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61ff3b12-30bf-48f6-bbb8-4e542689b76a', 'multiverseId': 287988}, 'multiverseid': 287988}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288144&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e9457ef-d891-4d2a-9aa8-b5a07c01bfcd', 'multiverseId': 288144}, 'multiverseid': 288144}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287832&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3356e682-5226-404e-b1fb-5478199eef5d', 'multiverseId': 287832}, 'multiverseid': 287832}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288300&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee450ef2-19d8-47f9-840f-f7415d87d462', 'multiverseId': 288300}, 'multiverseid': 288300}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288456&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a878f4e-8e71-4e2e-bd80-07f68b92419a', 'multiverseId': 288456}, 'multiverseid': 288456}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287990&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a56d051d-7ebf-4093-906e-7ba8e8235367', 'multiverseId': 287990}, 'multiverseid': 287990}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288146&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20d7f8b0-e8c2-4417-9436-73f86118e1a2', 'multiverseId': 288146}, 'multiverseid': 288146}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287834&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '707113c5-67dd-4756-bdc6-9195fe33c7ec', 'multiverseId': 287834}, 'multiverseid': 287834}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288302&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3500efe-e03e-4aac-924b-95564466454d', 'multiverseId': 288302}, 'multiverseid': 288302}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288458&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81694942-acea-4fd3-bf66-f55148565371', 'multiverseId': 288458}, 'multiverseid': 288458}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287998&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13128a0c-13c2-4abb-a1c6-daefc63098ff', 'multiverseId': 287998}, 'multiverseid': 287998}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288154&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e78e966-a8bf-41f8-b5c2-0d69942f5162', 'multiverseId': 288154}, 'multiverseid': 288154}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287842&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2ff5793-1373-4287-9f3f-400bdbadc12e', 'multiverseId': 287842}, 'multiverseid': 287842}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288310&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37deb7be-adcc-41f7-8122-3dcb96f200e6', 'multiverseId': 288310}, 'multiverseid': 288310}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288466&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ac30749-8b44-479e-aa67-c9ea233ecfff', 'multiverseId': 288466}, 'multiverseid': 288466}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288002&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c6ad3fc-a9fd-4c2f-b1dc-4f0305511b5e', 'multiverseId': 288002}, 'multiverseid': 288002}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288158&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5af60196-87ea-429a-8e8a-a55c32e19bf4', 'multiverseId': 288158}, 'multiverseid': 288158}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287846&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99e392fc-c326-48e4-972b-bf89314c0154', 'multiverseId': 287846}, 'multiverseid': 287846}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288314&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbbb043b-6953-4c85-9d8a-a9ff0f18d1ec', 'multiverseId': 288314}, 'multiverseid': 288314}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288470&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f60c75a3-755e-4fd6-b0ad-5e2304663b15', 'multiverseId': 288470}, 'multiverseid': 288470}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erratische Explosion\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur oder einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die kein Land ist. Die Erratische Explosion fügt dieser Kreatur oder diesem Spieler so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte betragen. Lege die auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad569dc-61e4-40c1-808c-eb2403f881e0\', \'multiverseId\': 287923}, \'multiverseid\': 287923}, {\'name\': \'Explosión errátil\', \'text\': \'Elige una criatura o jugador objetivo. Muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta que no sea tierra. La Explosión errátil hace daño igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta a esa criatura o jugador. Pon las cartas mostradas en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5acd04-25fb-4ccf-810c-bd2246d0728e\', \'multiverseId\': 288079}, \'multiverseid\': 288079}, {\'name\': \'Explosion imprévisible\', \'text\': "Choisissez une cible, créature ou joueur. Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte non-terrain. L\'Explosion imprévisible inflige à cette créature ou à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte. Mettez les cartes ainsi révélées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f9394d-6921-422e-9761-d53154320473\', \'multiverseId\': 287767}, \'multiverseid\': 287767}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Erratica\', \'text\': "Scegli una creatura o un giocatore bersaglio. Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta non terra. L\'Esplosione Erratica infligge a quella creatura o a quel giocatore danno pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta. Metti le carte rivelate in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eeffeb4-fa04-44dd-860f-30186be4613a\', \'multiverseId\': 288235}, \'multiverseid\': 288235}, {\'name\': \'うつろう爆発\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。 あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、土地でないカードが公開されるまで公開し続ける。うつろう爆発はそのクリーチャーやプレイヤーに、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。 それらの公開したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd0ca25-a3a2-41e7-8230-2e331fbde937\', \'multiverseId\': 288391}, \'multiverseid\': 288391}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten." —Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060ae4f2-3a58-4548-b8f3-a7ccea176197\', \'multiverseId\': 287967}, \'multiverseid\': 287967}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega a tu reserva de maná un maná de cualquier color que pudiera producir una tierra que controle un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos." —Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5922ae-f26b-4a26-b774-dd7bda18bd29\', \'multiverseId\': 288123}, \'multiverseid\': 288123}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez à votre réserve un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur qu\'un terrain contrôlé par un adversaire pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. » —Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f174815d-c4b7-45a6-b651-cac565574eae\', \'multiverseId\': 287811}, \'multiverseid\': 287811}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi alla tua riserva di mana un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli." —Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46d61c67-9a00-41dd-b18b-b05d972d9f32\', \'multiverseId\': 288279}, \'multiverseid\': 288279}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、いずれかの対戦相手がコントロールする土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。 起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。 水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」 ――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f447beca-29ae-44fd-9f47-509329f78896\', \'multiverseId\': 288435}, \'multiverseid\': 288435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuer von Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nOpfere die Feuer von Yavimaya: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a932559e-aaf9-4f9b-8fce-422f8cdf94bd\', \'multiverseId\': 287977}, \'multiverseid\': 287977}, {\'name\': \'Fuegos de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nSacrificar los Fuegos de Yavimaya: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50130cd2-37ea-43c1-adcb-11530a93ed87\', \'multiverseId\': 288133}, \'multiverseid\': 288133}, {\'name\': \'Feux de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nSacrifiez les Feux de la Yavimaya : La créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6ebeb4-328f-48ae-a645-0e8a29882cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 287821}, \'multiverseid\': 287821}, {\'name\': \'Fuochi di Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nSacrifica i Fuochi di Yavimaya: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c58856cc-e0f3-4aec-8d06-a40b9be2112a\', \'multiverseId\': 288289}, \'multiverseid\': 288289}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの火\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nヤヴィマヤの火を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5afc724f-ca1e-46f1-af4e-e26bbdd8b6ff\', \'multiverseId\': 288445}, \'multiverseid\': 288445}]', "[{'name': 'Feuriger Fall', 'text': 'Feuriger Fall fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland, zeige es offen vor und nimm es auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jund weidet sich an den Unvorbereiteten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287875&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f06ce4d6-54fd-41f9-b215-80f743aa5a7f', 'multiverseId': 287875}, 'multiverseid': 287875}, {'name': 'Caída ardiente', 'text': 'La Caída ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nCiclo de tierra básica {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Jund disfruta con los sorprendidos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288031&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86ad49b5-9d88-4150-bb0e-636f46f3cc77', 'multiverseId': 288031}, 'multiverseid': 288031}, {'name': 'Chute ardente', 'text': 'La Chute ardente inflige 5 blessures à la créature ciblée.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Jund festoie des ingénus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287719&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33ea8f16-9746-424b-963c-d6a8fbdce497', 'multiverseId': 287719}, 'multiverseid': 287719}, {'name': 'Rovina Impetuosa', 'text': 'La Rovina Impetuosa infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nCicloterra base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Jund banchetta con gli sprovveduti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288187&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be2455b2-4aa4-4df0-bf09-5128f79678fd', 'multiverseId': 288187}, 'multiverseid': 288187}, {'name': '焦熱の落下', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の落下はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\\n基本土地サイクリング {1}{R} （{1}{R}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ジャンドは不注意な者をご馳走とする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288343&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a81f6a31-a276-45f4-af8f-8ad04907398c', 'multiverseId': 288343}, 'multiverseid': 288343}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuriges Ende\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Feuriges Ende zu wirken.\\nFeuriges Ende fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Boros-Legionär sah ein edles Selbstopfer, der Rakdos-Raufbold sah einen flammenden Selbstmord, und für den Izzet-Alchimist war es ein Experiment, das gründlich schief gegangen war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04251316-18ea-44b9-a786-a1f05d571f52\', \'multiverseId\': 287969}, \'multiverseid\': 287969}, {\'name\': \'Conclusión ardiente\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar la Conclusión ardiente, sacrifica una criatura.\\nLa Conclusión ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El legionario boros vio un noble sacrificio, el malhechor rakdos un suicida en llamas y el alquimista ízzet un experimento que salió mal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'759cff55-a514-4f30-a3a8-cbb75bd1a05b\', \'multiverseId\': 288125}, \'multiverseid\': 288125}, {\'name\': \'Conclusion ardente\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer la Conclusion ardente, sacrifiez une créature.\\nLa Conclusion ardente inflige 5 blessures à la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le légionnaire boros vit un noble sacrifice, l\'étrangleur rakdos, une immolation, et l\'alchimiste izzet, une expérience qui avait mal tourné.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e60c18-41b9-45f6-9f2d-9f34840403bf\', \'multiverseId\': 287813}, \'multiverseid\': 287813}, {\'name\': \'Esito Ardente\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare l\'Esito Ardente, sacrifica una creatura.\\nL\'Esito Ardente infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il legionario Boros vide un nobile sacrificio, il thug Rakdos un feroce suicidio e l\'alchimista Izzet un esperimento finito male.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb2876a6-51bc-4154-a2b1-8f2ea11a1572\', \'multiverseId\': 288281}, \'multiverseid\': 288281}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の結末\', \'text\': \'焦熱の結末を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の結末はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ボロスの軍団が見たのは尊い自己犠牲だったし、ラクドスのごろつきが見たのは焼身自殺だったし、イゼットの錬金術師が見たのは失敗した実験だった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfba1d7-fb43-40e1-beb2-6395ea42b67d\', \'multiverseId\': 288437}, \'multiverseid\': 288437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flugstunde\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Flugstunde zu wirken.\\nDie Flugstunde fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Auf halbem Weg zum Ziel schwor sich Snukk, sich nicht noch einmal austricksen zu lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0469ea-aadc-46b4-a6eb-a53d0814ac2e\', \'multiverseId\': 287953}, \'multiverseid\': 287953}, {\'name\': \'Arrojar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar Arrojar, sacrifica una criatura.\\nArrojar hace daño igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A mitad de camino, Snukk juró que era la última vez que lo engañaban.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6adda71-2251-4d2e-9f61-3aa1cf37da42\', \'multiverseId\': 288109}, \'multiverseid\': 288109}, {\'name\': \'Jet\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer le Jet, sacrifiez une créature.\\nLe Jet inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À mi-trajet de la cible, Snukk jura qu\'on ne l\'y reprendrait plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00814b07-9aa1-4a3c-b5ce-4b273c2650ef\', \'multiverseId\': 287797}, \'multiverseid\': 287797}, {\'name\': \'Scagliare\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare Scagliare, sacrifica una creatura.\\nScagliare infligge danno pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "A metà strada dal bersaglio, Snukk giurò che era stato fregato per l\'ultima volta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3b4c072-eccf-4f77-9f57-fd642aa65397\', \'multiverseId\': 288265}, \'multiverseid\': 288265}, {\'name\': \'投げ飛ばし\', \'text\': \'投げ飛ばしを唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。投げ飛ばしはそれに、その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'スヌックは目標の半ば辺りで、騙されるのもこれが最後だと誓った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b35d835-3857-4ad2-82cc-0cbf9aab162d\', \'multiverseId\': 288421}, \'multiverseid\': 288421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fragmentlose Agentin\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a840a52b-553a-46b7-9e2b-006a5bdfe981\', \'multiverseId\': 287864}, \'multiverseid\': 287864}, {\'name\': \'Agente sin fragmento\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12859ba1-241f-486c-a832-55960bebf204\', \'multiverseId\': 288020}, \'multiverseid\': 288020}, {\'name\': \'Agente sans éclat\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6249dd22-99c1-45fc-89df-b0e6d55e8d40\', \'multiverseId\': 287708}, \'multiverseid\': 287708}, {\'name\': \'Agente di Nessun Frammento\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2943c2a-f19b-475d-8370-011f65f804a9\', \'multiverseId\': 288176}, \'multiverseid\': 288176}, {\'name\': \'断片無き工作員\', \'text\': \'続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc5fe5fc-4ba4-4410-8cc6-10507a0264e9\', \'multiverseId\': 288332}, \'multiverseid\': 288332}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frostmauer\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nImmer wenn die Frostmauer eine Kreatur blockt, enttappt diese Kreatur nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist mir nur Recht. Auf der Weide gibt es kein Unkraut mehr, und die Wölfe sind alle festgefroren." —Lumi, Ziegenhirte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41162047-8bf4-40ab-9166-a936980b3151\', \'multiverseId\': 287929}, \'multiverseid\': 287929}, {\'name\': \'Muro de escarcha\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nSiempre que el Muro de escarcha bloquee a una criatura, esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Me alegra su llegada. El pastizal se libra de las malezas y los lobos se congelan." —Lumi, pastora de cabras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab6610c-c846-42c8-b6b2-44a961919fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 288085}, \'multiverseid\': 288085}, {\'name\': \'Mur de gel\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mur de gel bloque une créature, cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': \'« Il est le bienvenu. Les pâturages sont débarrassés des mauvaises herbes et les loups sont gelés. » —Lumi, chevrière\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020442cc-e297-4ce4-9a3a-5a8b79cdfd2c\', \'multiverseId\': 287773}, \'multiverseid\': 287773}, {\'name\': \'Muro di Gelo\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nOgniqualvolta il Muro di Gelo blocca una creatura, quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi fa molto piacere. I pascoli sono privi di erbacce e i lupi sono congelati." —Lumi, pastorella\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5fdcf6-7bf4-4e9c-932b-538603354e07\', \'multiverseId\': 288241}, \'multiverseid\': 288241}, {\'name\': \'霜の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n霜の壁がクリーチャーを１体ブロックするたび、そのブロックされたクリーチャーはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「大歓迎ですよ。 牧地の雑草は無くなるし、狼も凍り固まっちゃうんですから。」 ――ヤギ飼いのルミ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16dc2369-3a0f-4990-94c3-4716d9574e79\', \'multiverseId\': 288397}, \'multiverseid\': 288397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fusionselementar\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Als sich die Fragmente im Mahlstrom wieder vereinigten, erschufen die Manaströme neue monströse Wesen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'610a9bba-bf35-48b0-98e1-0d039047c7ee\', \'multiverseId\': 287876}, \'multiverseid\': 287876}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de la fusión\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras los fragmentos se fundían en el Remolino, sus energías de maná se fusionaban en nuevas monstruosidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65c1de6-7d01-40cf-adaf-aec0a548ef5b\', \'multiverseId\': 288032}, \'multiverseid\': 288032}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de fusion\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que les éclats fusionnaient dans le Maelstrom, l\'énergie de leurs manas s\'amalgamait pour donner naissance à de nouvelles monstruosités.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f03be9e-880e-451e-b170-a842b1dbd9a2\', \'multiverseId\': 287720}, \'multiverseid\': 287720}, {\'name\': \'Elementale della Fusione\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Quando i frammenti si fusero attorno al Maelstrom, le loro energie di mana si mescolarono assieme originando nuove mostruosità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53daad60-c49e-4ca5-b2ab-1807c5aea0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 288188}, \'multiverseid\': 288188}, {\'name\': \'融合の精霊\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'断片が大渦の中で繋がりあうとき、そのマナのエネルギーは融合し、新たな怪物となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066f6090-ec7b-4458-a053-db400983993d\', \'multiverseId\': 288344}, \'multiverseid\': 288344}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287978&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08f70991-3931-467b-a684-2903e57e3993', 'multiverseId': 287978}, 'multiverseid': 287978}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288134&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bee4761-ecc8-4d6b-968e-ef57fb9f3ad0', 'multiverseId': 288134}, 'multiverseid': 288134}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287822&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c906b755-5c5d-4b45-991e-568919f37c9d', 'multiverseId': 287822}, 'multiverseid': 287822}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288290&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3326c66-7c1b-47a1-92df-eea51c0e643f', 'multiverseId': 288290}, 'multiverseid': 288290}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288446&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd270a4e4-27ec-469e-b030-8808f6b136e8', 'multiverseId': 288446}, 'multiverseid': 288446}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287980&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '377e7c23-41f3-4607-86c9-3dbe2f8fafdb', 'multiverseId': 287980}, 'multiverseid': 287980}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288136&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d248b76-948c-44c9-8dff-9d51840a648b', 'multiverseId': 288136}, 'multiverseid': 288136}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287824&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e246ca4-3baa-4973-8881-3c0d75f519fd', 'multiverseId': 287824}, 'multiverseid': 287824}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288292&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbbd15af-06ba-489f-8c37-224c8173df77', 'multiverseId': 288292}, 'multiverseid': 288292}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288448&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10627100-e701-4c37-b4dd-ef438bbb59af', 'multiverseId': 288448}, 'multiverseid': 288448}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287994&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f0915e5-fc04-4c11-8ff2-bf7a9abc883d', 'multiverseId': 287994}, 'multiverseid': 287994}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288150&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12fd707c-459f-4268-b566-e8a225f33c50', 'multiverseId': 288150}, 'multiverseid': 288150}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287838&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dc2a157-d2b0-4824-97fe-cbaae5d68071', 'multiverseId': 287838}, 'multiverseid': 287838}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288306&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88d510f7-5093-470d-8ffc-8a66063d2deb', 'multiverseId': 288306}, 'multiverseid': 288306}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c117ceb5-0714-49d6-8183-646ef9951d70', 'multiverseId': 288462}, 'multiverseid': 288462}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287999&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a660022f-5f85-4c51-9adb-04e7312e7146', 'multiverseId': 287999}, 'multiverseid': 287999}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288155&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48ef32f4-304c-4a58-8902-cab20f39cb82', 'multiverseId': 288155}, 'multiverseid': 288155}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287843&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02e0883c-c384-48cb-b630-6f16b617eeb8', 'multiverseId': 287843}, 'multiverseid': 287843}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288311&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5299df0-99c7-4670-9336-efa060ded0bc', 'multiverseId': 288311}, 'multiverseid': 288311}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288467&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64be0913-5355-4aa3-b6aa-359ff9b17200', 'multiverseId': 288467}, 'multiverseid': 288467}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Schleim\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerschlingen 1 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Jund endet alles irgendwann einmal im Magen eines anderen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5839271a-911b-4188-9f1d-4837f2c5fb75\', \'multiverseId\': 287877}, \'multiverseid\': 287877}, {\'name\': \'Fango glotón\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nDevorar 1. (En cuanto esto entra al campo de batalla puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'En Jund, todo termina eventualmente en el estómago de algo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce4c59b-6db0-4317-8232-b81622fe137e\', \'multiverseId\': 288033}, \'multiverseid\': 288033}, {\'name\': \'Boue gloutonne\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nDévorement 1 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier le nombre de créatures de votre choix. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': "Sur Jund, tout finit dans l\'estomac de quelque chose.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287721&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10fa4139-3e06-4083-b0b0-943aa9c02262\', \'multiverseId\': 287721}, \'multiverseid\': 287721}, {\'name\': \'Melma Affamata\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nDivorare 1 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Entra nel campo di battaglia con altrettanti segnalini +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': "In Jund, praticamente qualsiasi cosa termina la sua esistenza nello stomaco di qualcos\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68763d18-3a1f-47dc-9014-5b5b53d37fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 288189}, \'multiverseid\': 288189}, {\'name\': \'暴食するスライム\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n貪食 １ （これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。 このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'ジャンドでは、全てが最後には誰かの腹に収まる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204b7617-db29-4cff-ba0b-62beb26a6cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 288345}, \'multiverseid\': 288345}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geistermantel\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und Schutz vor Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Diese Hülle aus unantastbarer Reinheit schützt so gut wie jede geschmiedete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bcb8db4-a409-4fcf-ac0d-ca0a8c1c5197\', \'multiverseId\': 287975}, \'multiverseid\': 287975}, {\'name\': \'Manto espiritual\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene protección contra criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'El escudo de pureza intachable es tan fuerte como algo forjado en el yunque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d482d4-11d8-46fc-811b-b84e2065265c\', \'multiverseId\': 288131}, \'multiverseid\': 288131}, {\'name\': "Manteau d\'esprits", \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a la protection contre les créatures.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Un bouclier de pureté incorruptible est aussi fort qu\'un bouclier forgé sur l\'enclume.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4254f1e-4c95-4738-bffa-919c7251c0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 287819}, \'multiverseid\': 287819}, {\'name\': \'Manto Spirituale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha protezione dalle creature.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Lo scudo di indiscutibile purezza è forte quanto uno scudo lavorato sull\'incudine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed5923d-3d80-4c03-923c-8161dcdf3323\', \'multiverseId\': 288287}, \'multiverseid\': 288287}, {\'name\': \'霊魂のマントル\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともにプロテクション（クリーチャー）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'非の打ち所の無い純潔さの盾は、金床の上で鍛えられたものと同じぐらいに強い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c108cf0-a2e0-439d-9501-69749c1cc3ed\', \'multiverseId\': 288443}, \'multiverseid\': 288443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gepanzerter Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn ein Auftrag über einen Greifenharnisch hereinkommt, bereiten Schmiede sich auf monatelang Fleißarbeit vor. Sie wissen, dass Greifen auch die kleinsten Fehler entdecken und niemals feilschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a86edee-cd85-460b-9736-7772976ff6c6\', \'multiverseId\': 287959}, \'multiverseid\': 287959}, {\'name\': \'Grifo acorazado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando llega una nueva orden de grifos, los herreros preparan sus fraguas para meses de trabajo duro. Saben que los grifos siempre detectan imperfecciones y nunca las aceptan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52c6f4b-845e-429e-ad95-2ba6e79f33d5\', \'multiverseId\': 288115}, \'multiverseid\': 288115}, {\'name\': \'Griffon cuirassé\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'ils reçoivent une commande pour un griffon, les armuriers se préparent pour plusieurs mois de travail minutieux. Ils savent que les griffons détectent toute imperfection et ne marchandent jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b835a8-1e2c-485e-aadb-f2f6125a374a\', \'multiverseId\': 287803}, \'multiverseid\': 287803}, {\'name\': \'Grifone Corazzato\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'Quando arriva un ordine per la bardatura di un grifone, i fabbri preparano le forge per mesi e mesi di lavoro impegnativo. Sanno che i grifoni scoprono sempre le imperfezioni e non contrattano mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142cd6d2-c40e-4835-b39c-dc09b08516e6\', \'multiverseId\': 288271}, \'multiverseid\': 288271}, {\'name\': \'鎧のグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'グリフィン隊への注文が来るとき、鍛冶屋は数ヶ月にわたる正確な仕事の準備をする。 グリフィンは常に欠陥を見つけ、支払いをけちらないからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c060f20-b5e9-418c-a61b-7f7ced7466f4\', \'multiverseId\': 288427}, \'multiverseid\': 288427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gequälte Seele\', \'text\': \'Die Gequälte Seele kann nicht blocken und ist unblockbar.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die im Leben am bitterlichsten über die Welt klagten, müssen den Tod in den Zwischenwelten verbringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6da1b2-ddee-4919-8f39-a8be1a2c9c2c\', \'multiverseId\': 287909}, \'multiverseid\': 287909}, {\'name\': \'Alma atormentada\', \'text\': \'El Alma atormentada no puede bloquear y es imbloqueable.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes en vida estaban consumidos por la amargura y la ira son condenados a vagar por los reinos del submundo tras su muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78269f6-e11d-4072-8b4a-1df016b96499\', \'multiverseId\': 288065}, \'multiverseid\': 288065}, {\'name\': \'Âme tourmentée\', \'text\': "L\'Âme tourmentée ne peut pas bloquer et elle est imblocable.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus amèrement furieux envers le monde quand ils étaient en vie sont condamnés à hanter les royaumes souterrains dans la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce75ad9-9483-457b-ad36-a3d6deee1b66\', \'multiverseId\': 287753}, \'multiverseid\': 287753}, {\'name\': \'Anima Tormentata\', \'text\': "L\'Anima Tormentata non può bloccare e non può essere bloccata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che hanno inveito con più astio contro il mondo in vita sono condannati a vagare negli inferi da morti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df71756-389f-4197-a035-5cd3d8d5f1d1\', \'multiverseId\': 288221}, \'multiverseid\': 288221}, {\'name\': \'苛まれし魂\', \'text\': \'苛まれし魂ではブロックできず、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'世界に対して命がけで最も辛辣に怒りをぶつけた者は、冥界を死してさまよう呪いを受ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baaf92cc-0bb1-4f38-85a9-c44efaaea407\', \'multiverseId\': 288377}, \'multiverseid\': 288377}]', "[{'name': 'Gescheckter Frischling', 'text': 'Wenn der Gescheckte Frischling stirbt, bringe einen 3/3 grünen Wildschwein-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wildschwein', 'flavor': 'Jäger locken den Frischling ins offene Gelände, um dadurch größere Beute zu fangen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287848&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e37bf15-d8bc-4839-91d4-3fd95cc1e995', 'multiverseId': 287848}, 'multiverseid': 287848}, {'name': 'Cochinillo moteado', 'text': 'Cuando el Cochinillo moteado muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Jabalí verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Criatura — Jabalí', 'flavor': 'Los cazadores atraían al joven jabalí al claro, esperando atrapar presas más grandes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288004&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18b31a1b-d511-4392-9c08-a901c0a32350', 'multiverseId': 288004}, 'multiverseid': 288004}, {'name': 'Marcassin moucheté', 'text': 'Quand le Marcassin moucheté meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Sanglier.', 'type': 'Créature : sanglier', 'flavor': 'Les chasseurs attirent le jeune sanglier à découvert, espérant ainsi piéger une proie plus grosse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287692&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e386c790-2012-44c3-be85-3be54a2dce6f', 'multiverseId': 287692}, 'multiverseid': 287692}, {'name': 'Cucciolo Pezzato', 'text': 'Quando il Cucciolo Pezzato muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Cinghiale 3/3 verde.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cinghiale', 'flavor': 'I cacciatori attirano il cinghialetto allo scoperto, nella speranza di intrappolare prede più grandi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288160&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a681ea10-1263-40db-8767-8aa5a64e1333', 'multiverseId': 288160}, 'multiverseid': 288160}, {'name': '斑の子猪', 'text': '斑の子猪が死亡したとき、緑の３/３の猪・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猪', 'flavor': '狩人は縞模様の猪を空き地におびき寄せ、さらに大きい獲物を狙う。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288316&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '182ef1c6-7c41-4f2d-a189-f1601487e8a4', 'multiverseId': 288316}, 'multiverseid': 288316}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gespenstisches Gefängnis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, falls ihr Beherrscher nicht für jede dich angreifende Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, {2} bezahlt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Möge die Erinnerung an unsere gefallenen Helden die ungestümen Seelen niederer Männer bändigen." —Inschrift der Großen Schwelle von Monserkat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f75c2bd-7233-4eac-b9ab-7aa5d04753d5\', \'multiverseId\': 287974}, \'multiverseid\': 287974}, {\'name\': \'Prisión fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que el recuerdo de nuestros héroes caídos atrape los corazones violentos de hombres menos valientes." —Inscripción en el Gran Umbral de Monserkat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb979d06-3b3d-4ae5-bf77-a4744496fa5f\', \'multiverseId\': 288130}, \'multiverseid\': 288130}, {\'name\': \'Prison fantomale\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Que la mémoire de nos héros tombés ensorcelle les cœurs violents des impurs. » —Inscription du Grand Seuil de Monserkat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea034fc3-5208-4a92-b52d-dcbf35e95ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 287818}, \'multiverseid\': 287818}, {\'name\': \'Prigione Spettrale\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Possa il ricordo dei nostri eroi caduti intrappolare i cuori violenti degli uomini inferiori." —Iscrizione sulla Grande Soglia di Monserkat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc5c2070-1624-431e-a0fb-60006dad536c\', \'multiverseId\': 288286}, \'multiverseid\': 288286}, {\'name\': \'亡霊の牢獄\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーは、それのコントローラーが、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするあなたを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、あなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「死せる英雄たちの記憶が、小さき者の逸る心を虜にしますように。」 ――モンザーカットの大門口に刻まれた文句\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d890281-907e-4607-8581-0584a4a44121\', \'multiverseId\': 288442}, \'multiverseid\': 288442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesplitteter Kraftstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{T}: Wirf den Weltenwürfel. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Thran lernten, das Mana zu binden, doch Kraft entkommt unausweichlich seinen Fesseln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3c7558-8217-4bc4-97db-ed8770d63460\', \'multiverseId\': 287853}, \'multiverseid\': 287853}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de poder fracturada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}: Lanza el dado planar. Activa esta habilidad sólo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los Thran aprendieron a capturar el maná pero el poder inevitablemente escapa a sus límites.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302846dd-20c6-4308-ae39-3bffce34bcf9\', \'multiverseId\': 288009}, \'multiverseid\': 288009}, {\'name\': \'Lithoforce fracturée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{T} : Lancez le dé planaire. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les Thran ont appris à capturer le mana, mais le pouvoir finit toujours par s\'échapper de sa prison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287697&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'072e39f3-77fa-4f8c-8bd0-f57ace4ac59d\', \'multiverseId\': 287697}, \'multiverseid\': 287697}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Potere Spezzata\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}: Tira il dado planare. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I Thran appresero a catturare il mana, ma il potere inevitabilmente sfugge ai suoi vincoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d79b694-8d8b-4b25-8f8a-dad38eceecab\', \'multiverseId\': 288165}, \'multiverseid\': 288165}, {\'name\': \'砕けたパワーストーン\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}：次元ダイスをふる。 この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'スランはマナを捕える術を学んだが、力は否応なく戒めから逃げていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9a2f10-d401-4eac-ae5b-b4e3d75b1d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 288321}, \'multiverseid\': 288321}]', "[{'name': 'Gomazoa-Wachposten', 'text': 'Verteidiger, Fliegend\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der dem Gomazoa-Wachposten zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Qualle', 'flavor': 'Er hält sich in der Nähe der Makindi-Gräben auf und sorgt damit unfreiwillig für eine weitere Schutzschicht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288003&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4cb0894-4161-4f60-9302-81bcd84189bc', 'multiverseId': 288003}, 'multiverseid': 288003}, {'name': 'Gomazoa guardiana', 'text': 'Defensor, vuela.\\nPrevén todo el daño de combate que se le fuera a hacer a la Gomazoa guardiana.', 'type': 'Criatura — Medusa', 'flavor': 'Acecha cerca de los destacamentos de las Trincheras Makindi, añadiendo sin querer otra línea de defensa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288159&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '829f9ad2-a2bc-432d-98f5-c3115423090e', 'multiverseId': 288159}, 'multiverseid': 288159}, {'name': 'Garde gomazoaire', 'text': 'Défenseur, volPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées au Garde gomazoaire.', 'type': 'Créature : méduse', 'flavor': 'Il rôde près des avant-postes des Fosses de Makindi, leur donnant par inadvertance un système de défense supplémentaire.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287847&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c45260c-482b-43a6-bcef-8d3c20b5b494', 'multiverseId': 287847}, 'multiverseid': 287847}, {'name': 'Gomazoa di Guardia', 'text': 'Difensore, volare\\nPrevieni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alla Gomazoa di Guardia.', 'type': 'Creatura — Medusa', 'flavor': 'Si sofferma vicino agli avamposti delle Fosse di Makindi, garantendo suo malgrado un ulteriore livello di difese.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288315&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '411abcc1-f731-4e29-afd7-cbbd22929445', 'multiverseId': 288315}, 'multiverseid': 288315}, {'name': '護衛のゴーマゾア', 'text': '防衛、飛行\\n護衛のゴーマゾアに与えられるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — クラゲ', 'flavor': 'それはマキンディ溝の前哨地の近くに居座り、偶然にも追加の防衛線となっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288471&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61cf88e3-bf53-4ed3-ab25-8638ea7a5d4e', 'multiverseId': 288471}, 'multiverseid': 288471}]", "[{'name': 'Graupelz-Refugium', 'text': 'Das Graupelz-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Graupelz-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287869&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aa13d0d-76ee-4117-8ad6-0ff79ed7003b', 'multiverseId': 287869}, 'multiverseid': 287869}, {'name': 'Refugio de Pellejo Gris', 'text': 'El Refugio de Pellejo Gris entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Pellejo Gris entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288025&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4122d55-4f01-4fb8-9b49-817cb6f308b3', 'multiverseId': 288025}, 'multiverseid': 288025}, {'name': 'Refuge de Grisepeau', 'text': 'Le Refuge de Grisepeau arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de Grisepeau arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287713&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fb84ca3-d34d-48a9-bf75-df343d9fb8f4', 'multiverseId': 287713}, 'multiverseid': 287713}, {'name': 'Rifugio di Pellegrigia', 'text': 'Il Rifugio di Pellegrigia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Pellegrigia entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288181&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '189c5359-8a1e-4c43-a509-fea2945c3d7b', 'multiverseId': 288181}, 'multiverseid': 288181}, {'name': '灰色革の隠れ家', 'text': '灰色革の隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n灰色革の隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288337&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fd34fae-0879-4437-97c4-d2b2bf28ed4b', 'multiverseId': 288337}, 'multiverseid': 288337}]", "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287956&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08210b6c-fa71-485d-9104-4c28895846c8', 'multiverseId': 287956}, 'multiverseid': 287956}, {'name': 'Territorio gruul', 'text': 'El Territorio gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Territorio gruul entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controles a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288112&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c14d774-6cbc-4b4d-aee0-17d1729a79d7', 'multiverseId': 288112}, 'multiverseid': 288112}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287800&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3449381-aeaa-44cd-9d01-141f393d20f9', 'multiverseId': 287800}, 'multiverseid': 287800}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288268&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd10bf214-154e-47f5-a8b8-d0c98f9dc5a4', 'multiverseId': 288268}, 'multiverseid': 288268}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地を１つオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288424&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1c26d84-aee7-4327-a1fb-fa106fcfd008', 'multiverseId': 288424}, 'multiverseid': 288424}]", "[{'name': 'Grüner Zorn', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nWenn der Grüne Zorn aus dem Spiel in einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Grünen Zorn auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287976&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd514d179-e4bf-47de-9a1f-1fdaf8b6c8a1', 'multiverseId': 287976}, 'multiverseid': 287976}, {'name': 'Rencor', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nCuando el Rencor vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa el Rencor a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288132&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e2379ef-19ce-43a3-93eb-dd5b0eef2df9', 'multiverseId': 288132}, 'multiverseid': 288132}, {'name': 'Rancœur', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+0 et a le piétinement.\\nQuand la Rancœur est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez la Rancœur dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287820&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eda2f0cd-7d23-4a85-9c01-c33dc41da5f2', 'multiverseId': 287820}, 'multiverseid': 287820}, {'name': 'Rancore', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+0 e ha travolgere.\\nQuando il Rancore viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, fai tornare il Rancore in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288288&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3a8e7ae-3699-4d34-ae8e-f15d08184914', 'multiverseId': 288288}, 'multiverseid': 288288}, {'name': '怨恨', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを持つ。\\n怨恨が戦場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、怨恨をオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288444&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56647bc9-85a4-48db-b6a5-62bb1ec5eff9', 'multiverseId': 288444}, 'multiverseid': 288444}]", '[{\'name\': \'Halbschatten-Spinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn die Halbschatten-Spinne stirbt, bringe einen 2/4 schwarzen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Als sie einen vorbeihuschenden Wolpertinger in ihrem Netz fing, verdoppelte und verdunkelte sich ihre Seele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568febf5-697c-4a8b-89c2-35da7d3fcb81\', \'multiverseId\': 287952}, \'multiverseid\': 287952}, {\'name\': \'Araña Penumbra\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando la Araña Penumbra muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Araña negra 2/4 con la habilidad de alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando atrapó una cocatriz pasajera, su propia alma oscura se duplicó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6275f6ea-2913-488a-b5cd-f9b77e5f6d38\', \'multiverseId\': 288108}, \'multiverseid\': 288108}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de la pénombre\', \'text\': "Portée\\nQuand l\'Araignée de la pénombre meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/4 noire Araignée avec la portée.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': \'Quand elle attrapait un cocatrix dans sa toile, son âme noire doublait de taille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ca014a-4d00-49c9-8405-7b20fc57f7e3\', \'multiverseId\': 287796}, \'multiverseid\': 287796}, {\'name\': \'Ragno della Penombra\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando il Ragno della Penombra muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Ragno 2/4 nera con raggiungere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando intrappolò una coccatrice di passaggio, la sua stessa anima si raddoppiò tetramente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9120f0da-7343-4018-9534-5b0003a92e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 288264}, \'multiverseid\': 288264}, {\'name\': \'暗影の蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達\\n暗影の蜘蛛が死亡したとき、到達を持つ黒の２/４の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'通り過ぎるコカトリスを絡め取ったとき、その魂は暗い魂を産んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97442c69-98b9-40eb-9f07-c11d595e2098\', \'multiverseId\': 288420}, \'multiverseid\': 288420}]', "[{'name': 'Higure, der laue Wind', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{U} ({2}{U}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn Higure, der laue Wind, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ninja-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du dies tust, mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\n{2}: Eine Ninja-Kreatur deiner Wahl ist in diesem Zug unblockbar.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287913&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63659bb0-bd9e-4ac8-93a3-f40bcc616a02', 'multiverseId': 287913}, 'multiverseid': 287913}, {'name': 'Higure, el viento quieto', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{U}. ({2}{U}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que Higure, el viento quieto haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes buscar una carta de Ninja en tu biblioteca, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si lo haces, baraja tu biblioteca.\\n{2}: La criatura Ninja objetivo es imbloqueable este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Ninja humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288069&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a614cc-76a6-46fd-951d-5706299415fe', 'multiverseId': 288069}, 'multiverseid': 288069}, {'name': 'Higure, le vent immobile', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{U} ({2}{U}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que Higure, le vent immobile inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez chercher une carte de ninja dans votre bibliothèque, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous faites ainsi, mélangez votre bibliothèque.\\n{2} : La créature Ninja ciblée est imblocable ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287757&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82fda2f3-9ed7-4155-b807-f5839fc9d844', 'multiverseId': 287757}, 'multiverseid': 287757}, {'name': 'Higure, il Vento Immobile', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{U} ({2}{U}{U}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta Higure, il Vento Immobile infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Ninja, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se lo fai, rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\n{2}: Una creatura Ninja bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Ninja Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288225&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eaaae0c6-c59d-4661-b55e-d0e73370557b', 'multiverseId': 288225}, 'multiverseid': 288225}, {'name': '静風の日暮', 'text': '忍術 {2}{U}{U} （{2}{U}{U}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n静風の日暮がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは自分のライブラリーから忍者カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。 そうした場合、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n{2}：忍者・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288381&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a252d16b-c0b5-4f62-8827-94283ffbeb52', 'multiverseId': 288381}, 'multiverseid': 288381}]", '[{\'name\': \'Himmlisches Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir dachten, die Wolken wären vom Nachthimmel weggezogen. Dann bewegte sich der Nachthimmel, und dem Horizont wuchsen Flügel." —Josuri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb0299f-1dad-4eb5-a2f9-93ff5b42eba0\', \'multiverseId\': 287961}, \'multiverseid\': 287961}, {\'name\': \'Ancestro celestial\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Pensamos que las nubes se había movido del cielo. Luego se movió el cielo, y en el horizonte aparecieron sus alas." —Jósuri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa5fca1-9f25-435b-9654-ea3ea434bdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 288117}, \'multiverseid\': 288117}, {\'name\': \'Aïeule céleste\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Nous pensions que les nuages avaient disparu du ciel nocturne. C\'est alors que le ciel se mut, et que de l\'horizon apparurent des ailes. » —Josuri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98ed0e9-e08c-4745-a3d5-5766498c7f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 287805}, \'multiverseid\': 287805}, {\'name\': \'Antica Celestiale\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Pensavamo che le nuvole avessero lasciato il cielo stellato. Poi il cielo si mosse e all\\\'orizzonte spuntarono le ali." —Josuri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292e1e6b-3d32-4b73-9875-82d81ce8c281\', \'multiverseId\': 288273}, \'multiverseid\': 288273}, {\'name\': \'天界の古霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがエンチャント呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個ずつ置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「雲が夜空を動いたと思ったんだ。 そしたら、動いたのは夜空で、地平線が翼を生やしたのさ。」 ――ジョスリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a31b877-cc0c-48cd-90e1-8e930356a590\', \'multiverseId\': 288429}, \'multiverseid\': 288429}]', "[{'name': 'Höllendrachen-Küken', 'text': 'Verschlingen 1 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nDas Höllendrachen-Küken hat Flugfähigkeit und verursacht Trampelschaden, falls es mindestens eine Kreatur verschlungen hat.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': 'Von Geburt an eine Tötungsmaschine.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287878&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '685448a2-5cd2-4e23-bc05-a9c8213a88db', 'multiverseId': 287878}, 'multiverseid': 287878}, {'name': 'Cría de engendro', 'text': 'Devorar 1. (En cuanto esto entra al campo de batalla puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nLa Cría de engendro tiene las habilidades de volar y arrollar si devoró una criatura.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': 'Una máquina de matar desde la cuna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288034&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55432856-2f87-4944-937a-0948099e5eab', 'multiverseId': 288034}, 'multiverseid': 288034}, {'name': 'Progéniture escouflenfer', 'text': 'Dévorement 1 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier le nombre de créatures de votre choix. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nLa Progéniture escouflenfer a le vol et le piétinement si elle a dévoré une créature.', 'type': 'Créature : dragon', 'flavor': 'Une machine à tuer dès sa naissance.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287722&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4739b091-7d69-4300-a34d-190de5f2b72a', 'multiverseId': 287722}, 'multiverseid': 287722}, {'name': 'Cucciolo di Nibbio Infernale', 'text': 'Divorare 1 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Entra nel campo di battaglia con altrettanti segnalini +1/+1.)\\nIl Cucciolo di Nibbio Infernale ha volare e travolgere se ha divorato una creatura.', 'type': 'Creatura — Drago', 'flavor': 'Una macchina assassina fin dalla nascita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288190&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68677439-e34f-4db9-8a80-6a6d179f386d', 'multiverseId': 288190}, 'multiverseid': 288190}, {'name': 'ヘルカイトの雛', 'text': '貪食 １ （これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。 このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nヘルカイトの雛は、それがクリーチャーを貪食していた場合、飛行とトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': '生まれついての殺戮兵器。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288346&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f7557a3-f1f4-4b97-81fc-754d5bd5ae1b', 'multiverseId': 288346}, 'multiverseid': 288346}]", '[{\'name\': \'Illusorischer Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWirke den Illusorischen Engel nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen anderen Zauberspruch gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Illusion\', \'flavor\': \'„Ja, er wurde aus reinem Glauben erschaffen — aber ich verstehe nicht, warum ihn das einzigartig machen soll." —Reith, Meisterillusionist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb28850-906b-4215-b2e6-a7c3e5a518ac\', \'multiverseId\': 287849}, \'multiverseid\': 287849}, {\'name\': \'Ángel ilusorio\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLanza el Ángel ilusorio sólo si lanzaste otro hechizo este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel ilusión\', \'flavor\': \'"Sí, está hecha de pura creencia, pero no puedo ver por qué eso la hace única." —Reith, maestro ilusionista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad731903-ea6e-482f-8514-f6b5857b274a\', \'multiverseId\': 288005}, \'multiverseid\': 288005}, {\'name\': \'Ange illusoire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nNe lancez l\'Ange illusoire que si vous avez lancé un autre sort ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et illusion\', \'flavor\': \'« Certes, elle est constituée de pure foi, mais je ne vois pas en quoi cela la rend unique. » —Reith, maître illusionniste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287693&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'637456cb-e5e0-4c96-8804-7783878a1734\', \'multiverseId\': 287693}, \'multiverseid\': 287693}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Irreale\', \'text\': "Volare\\nLancia l\'Angelo Irreale solo se hai lanciato un\'altra magia in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sì, è fatta di pura fede... ma non vedo proprio perché questo debba renderla unica." —Reith, maestro illusionista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'030eb1be-fc0e-4589-abd4-54b9a3417ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 288161}, \'multiverseid\': 288161}, {\'name\': \'幻影の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n幻影の天使は、あなたがこのターンに他の呪文を唱えていたいた場合にのみ唱えられる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': \'「ああ、彼女は純然たる信念から生まれたものだ――ただ、そこから彼女が独特のものとなった理由はわからないな。」 ――幻術の達人、レイツ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8abdc2d-6ecf-4bcf-9af1-f6761c83bc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 288317}, \'multiverseid\': 288317}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland und bringe es getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97583ef6-d868-42d5-a566-f8add7fcb6f2\', \'multiverseId\': 287928}, \'multiverseid\': 287928}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e71a62-e076-4150-b8fd-d5e2951c4998\', \'multiverseId\': 288084}, \'multiverseid\': 288084}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69943e6a-5a85-46ac-b4d7-6d0891b0a1db\', \'multiverseId\': 287772}, \'multiverseid\': 287772}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec9f684-ea69-40ce-9847-65e3d95707bd\', \'multiverseId\': 288240}, \'multiverseid\': 288240}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91180134-85dc-436d-b9e4-110847c3c347\', \'multiverseId\': 288396}, \'multiverseid\': 288396}]', "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287981&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a410fa11-27e4-4ab2-91bd-731c6857ca3b', 'multiverseId': 287981}, 'multiverseid': 287981}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288137&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '027b0ad8-4ac7-449b-a088-bce9616f3123', 'multiverseId': 288137}, 'multiverseid': 288137}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287825&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4565abc-ebd9-4977-92be-f2d35663dab1', 'multiverseId': 287825}, 'multiverseid': 287825}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288293&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9703189-1591-4e11-a129-ddfab383a88f', 'multiverseId': 288293}, 'multiverseid': 288293}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288449&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c95823c-e6a8-46e0-ab62-ab7b83bc42a3', 'multiverseId': 288449}, 'multiverseid': 288449}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287982&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ba2e2cc-f5d9-46ce-9baa-dbc8a49e4bfe', 'multiverseId': 287982}, 'multiverseid': 287982}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288138&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35ec45ed-e7e5-4031-8cc5-27a886537783', 'multiverseId': 288138}, 'multiverseid': 288138}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287826&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dff26fe4-1fd5-4fe7-b4ea-dcdfb32b47c0', 'multiverseId': 287826}, 'multiverseid': 287826}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288294&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e593f186-f8fb-4ffe-83ca-3102c7afaafc', 'multiverseId': 288294}, 'multiverseid': 288294}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288450&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc0b5ff1-cb37-4dd2-aed8-03540a56e3eb', 'multiverseId': 288450}, 'multiverseid': 288450}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287991&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6a26141-d381-4399-a3a4-acbcf4973da5', 'multiverseId': 287991}, 'multiverseid': 287991}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288147&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef9db170-7ba9-48c1-99c5-88b03db50d78', 'multiverseId': 288147}, 'multiverseid': 288147}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287835&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bca6d27-efc7-4531-bd16-bbe3d23bb359', 'multiverseId': 287835}, 'multiverseid': 287835}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288303&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4eb2600e-a7fd-488f-9de1-7fb2f5f9dcad', 'multiverseId': 288303}, 'multiverseid': 288303}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288459&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9625f33-98bd-4e53-8033-1ea20dcbea95', 'multiverseId': 288459}, 'multiverseid': 288459}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287995&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04696a68-d86b-487a-942e-c28de5988098', 'multiverseId': 287995}, 'multiverseid': 287995}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288151&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2779d0a6-ba55-4ed9-946e-e561925e938f', 'multiverseId': 288151}, 'multiverseid': 288151}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287839&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daece0fd-95e2-4db1-9c8d-c35098471647', 'multiverseId': 287839}, 'multiverseid': 287839}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288307&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78f7727b-0ca3-4d22-96b6-eb372fb76e8e', 'multiverseId': 288307}, 'multiverseid': 288307}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288463&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24ba8130-0cbc-4498-b6ef-cedc3451a357', 'multiverseId': 288463}, 'multiverseid': 288463}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288000&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a1d7285-8a4e-4ec9-8ba0-321aa3b589f0', 'multiverseId': 288000}, 'multiverseid': 288000}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288156&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21a2e461-9416-4d3c-bc7a-c194c029b7a9', 'multiverseId': 288156}, 'multiverseid': 288156}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287844&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '154253c2-59fc-44d6-924d-ed5a7f617e63', 'multiverseId': 287844}, 'multiverseid': 287844}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288312&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f14ef3a6-1d3c-4709-8125-12f846e84b40', 'multiverseId': 288312}, 'multiverseid': 288312}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288468&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48d99769-a08b-4813-83b6-2f45a31a97ff', 'multiverseId': 288468}, 'multiverseid': 288468}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jwar-Insel-Refugium\', \'text\': \'Das Jwar-Insel-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Jwar-Insel-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed973ca-4dee-47c4-85e6-e398c86dcc38\', \'multiverseId\': 287870}, \'multiverseid\': 287870}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de la Isla Jwar\', \'text\': \'El Refugio de la Isla Jwar entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de la Isla Jwar entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44562e59-dda6-478f-891c-dd613e1c5ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 288026}, \'multiverseid\': 288026}, {\'name\': "Refuge de l\'île de Jwar", \'text\': "Le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1b80c2f-900a-440c-a907-356361f40481\', \'multiverseId\': 287714}, \'multiverseid\': 287714}, {\'name\': "Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar", \'text\': "Il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b97230a0-c7e8-408c-a280-b5fcc67ab097\', \'multiverseId\': 288182}, \'multiverseid\': 288182}, {\'name\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家\', \'text\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジュワー島の隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d454d868-cd9e-42ed-95e7-841ccc761703\', \'multiverseId\': 288338}, \'multiverseid\': 288338}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kadaverbold\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Kadaverbold ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückholen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Der Mund muss aufgeklappt werden, bevor die Totenstarre einsetzt. Anderenfalls findet die zurückkehrende Seele keinen Zutritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9040690e-bd18-4694-8f26-f883c695f1e0\', \'multiverseId\': 287893}, \'multiverseid\': 287893}, {\'name\': \'Diablillo de cadáveres\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Diablillo de cadáveres entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': \'La boca debe abrirse antes de que se produzca el rigor mortis. Si no, al volver el alma no encuentra manera de entrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba38060d-5241-48b4-82bb-3688c218699c\', \'multiverseId\': 288049}, \'multiverseid\': 288049}, {\'name\': \'Diablotin des cadavres\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Diablotin des cadavres arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': "La bouche doit être maintenue ouverte jusqu\'à l\'apparition de la raideur cadavérique. Sinon, l\'âme qui revient ne trouve pas de point d\'entrée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3490a690-38e6-4e0a-a8c5-d3ad3321f67e\', \'multiverseId\': 287737}, \'multiverseid\': 287737}, {\'name\': \'Imp dei Cadaveri\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Imp dei Cadaveri entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Imp\', \'flavor\': "La bocca deve essere aperta a forza prima che cominci il rigor mortis. Altrimenti l\'anima che ritorna non trova alcun accesso.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90be5c83-8523-46f5-9447-7ad8c0ee0872\', \'multiverseId\': 288205}, \'multiverseid\': 288205}, {\'name\': \'死者のインプ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n死者のインプが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インプ\', \'flavor\': \'死後硬直が始まる前に、口をこじ開けておかなければいけない。 そうしなければ、戻ってきた魂の入り口が見つからなくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4688ceca-b779-413f-be9e-e9128a89f5ce\', \'multiverseId\': 288361}, \'multiverseid\': 288361}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kathari-Überrest\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{B}: Regeneriere den Kathari-Überrest.\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Skelett\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9778015-f482-4460-aa43-4bb077e62014\', \'multiverseId\': 287921}, \'multiverseid\': 287921}, {\'name\': \'Restos kathari\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{B}: Regenera los Restos kathari.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c878501f-6728-4844-a8e9-52a599ee115a\', \'multiverseId\': 288077}, \'multiverseid\': 288077}, {\'name\': \'Vestige kathari\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{B} : Régénérez le Vestige kathari.\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et squelette\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5baf2e-44a2-430b-b34a-25af3ff38651\', \'multiverseId\': 287765}, \'multiverseid\': 287765}, {\'name\': \'Spoglia Kathari\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{B}: Rigenera la Spoglia Kathari.\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scheletro Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b0c727-8710-4d7c-8817-b41638fa980a\', \'multiverseId\': 288233}, \'multiverseid\': 288233}, {\'name\': \'カターリの残影\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{B}：カターリの残影を再生する。\\n続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・スケルトン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846c5dbc-ba19-4a49-a142-e0c801ecd3b2\', \'multiverseId\': 288389}, \'multiverseid\': 288389}]', "[{'name': 'Kazandu-Refugium', 'text': 'Das Kazandu-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Kazandu-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287871&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ac4904b-74aa-429e-8041-25e2807e0090', 'multiverseId': 287871}, 'multiverseid': 287871}, {'name': 'Refugio de Kazandu', 'text': 'El Refugio de Kazandu entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Kazandu entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288027&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb7e7a47-1c95-4e4f-b800-e6c6a5d8a220', 'multiverseId': 288027}, 'multiverseid': 288027}, {'name': 'Refuge du Kazandou', 'text': 'Le Refuge du Kazandou arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge du Kazandou arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287715&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11453295-00c0-41c2-ac5d-e2cdf00b2956', 'multiverseId': 287715}, 'multiverseid': 287715}, {'name': 'Rifugio di Kazandu', 'text': 'Il Rifugio di Kazandu entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Kazandu entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288183&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9172bd0a-a7ed-45bf-8728-6115e7bed48f', 'multiverseId': 288183}, 'multiverseid': 288183}, {'name': 'カザンドゥの隠れ家', 'text': 'カザンドゥの隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nカザンドゥの隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288339&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aeafdc17-4d77-4c4a-be9e-cd5f4670485f', 'multiverseId': 288339}, 'multiverseid': 288339}]", "[{'name': 'Kehlenschlitzer', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{B} ({2}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Kehlenschlitzer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ratte, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287919&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e66ca92-03ec-4a6f-a0cd-b2ec3dddb0de', 'multiverseId': 287919}, 'multiverseid': 287919}, {'name': 'Cortagargantas', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{B}. ({2}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Cortagargantas haga daño de combate a un jugador, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra que controle ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja rata', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288075&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25738784-0fa6-4a15-b08c-f546ab05b146', 'multiverseId': 288075}, 'multiverseid': 288075}, {'name': 'Tranche-gorge', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{B} ({2}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Tranche-gorge inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détruisez la créature non-noire ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.', 'type': 'Créature : rat et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287763&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '519e50b9-afd7-4e76-a571-661a95871f87', 'multiverseId': 287763}, 'multiverseid': 287763}, {'name': 'Tagliagole', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{B} ({2}{B}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Tagliagole infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, distruggi una creatura non nera bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Ratto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288231&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46787709-3cc9-4baa-a013-627e40e94c76', 'multiverseId': 288231}, 'multiverseid': 288231}, {'name': '喉笛切り', 'text': '忍術 {2}{B} （{2}{B}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n喉笛切りがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールする黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ネズミ・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288387&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '246b4434-4966-49e8-a7db-e397429bd1f9', 'multiverseId': 288387}, 'multiverseid': 288387}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kenner der geheimen Pfade\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Kenner der geheimen Pfade einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand dieses Spielers an.\\n{1}{U}: Bringe einen Ninja deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4438d91e-85a4-4d8c-a693-f7adb97ec2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 287920}, \'multiverseid\': 287920}, {\'name\': \'Caminante de la ruta secreta\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Caminante de la ruta secreta haga daño de combate a un jugador, mira la mano de ese jugador.\\n{1}{U}: Regresa el Ninja objetivo que controles a la mano de su propietario. Activa esta habilidad sólo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba98b3f7-c2aa-426b-a80b-347fc81e78c9\', \'multiverseId\': 288076}, \'multiverseid\': 288076}, {\'name\': \'Marcheuse des voies secrètes\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Marcheuse des voies secrètes inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la main de ce joueur.\\n{1}{U} : Renvoyez le ninja ciblé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire. N\'activez cette capacité que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa2bb7b-6786-46e4-b34e-ae4d84555e12\', \'multiverseId\': 287764}, \'multiverseid\': 287764}, {\'name\': \'Colei Che Va per Vie Segrete\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta Colei Che Va per Vie Segrete infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, guarda la mano di quel giocatore.\\n{1}{U}: Fai tornare un Ninja bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario. Attiva questa abilità solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfbc620-4067-4268-8b92-fed8df912798\', \'multiverseId\': 288232}, \'multiverseid\': 288232}, {\'name\': \'抜け道を歩む者\', \'text\': \'忍術 {1}{U} （{1}{U}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n抜け道を歩む者がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーの手札を見る。\\n{1}{U}：あなたがコントロールする忍者１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。 この能力は、あなたのターンの間にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2160be-b471-4be7-b325-cdd15d143298\', \'multiverseId\': 288388}, \'multiverseid\': 288388}]', "[{'name': 'Khalni-Garten', 'text': 'Der Khalni-Garten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Khalni-Garten ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 0/1 grünen Pflanzen-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287955&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dd0f3a3-77c7-4663-af99-ec60e23de2f4', 'multiverseId': 287955}, 'multiverseid': 287955}, {'name': 'Jardines de Khalni', 'text': 'Los Jardines de Khalni entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Jardines de Khalni entren al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Planta verde 0/1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288111&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66c19626-1952-4aa6-a4ec-c4961fc7aaab', 'multiverseId': 288111}, 'multiverseid': 288111}, {'name': 'Jardin de Khalni', 'text': 'Le Jardin de Khalni arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Jardin de Khalni arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 0/1 verte Plante.{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287799&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92d33d02-2156-4843-9f4d-d0a5218a2f07', 'multiverseId': 287799}, 'multiverseid': 287799}, {'name': 'Giardino di Khalni', 'text': 'Il Giardino di Khalni entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Giardino di Khalni entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Pianta 0/1 verde.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288267&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebb0d878-442b-4360-b351-59406441457b', 'multiverseId': 288267}, 'multiverseid': 288267}, {'name': 'カルニの庭', 'text': 'カルニの庭はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nカルニの庭が戦場に出たとき、緑の０/１の植物・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288423&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0ca406e-9617-4ee3-aa14-31ade0f0ca7e', 'multiverseId': 288423}, 'multiverseid': 288423}]", '[{\'name\': \'Knotenholz\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Knotenholz.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Von den Geistern in seinem Eichenholz beseelt sehnt er sich nach mehr Leben für seinen Kern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec4d513-69fc-401e-abbb-6eb1423b3285\', \'multiverseId\': 287960}, \'multiverseid\': 287960}, {\'name\': \'Nudomadera\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\\nSiempre que una criatura muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Nudomadera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'Animado por geists fusionados en un roble, busca más vida para agregar a su centro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf6fb07a-54dd-4ca9-97db-a5da1277ecbe\', \'multiverseId\': 288116}, \'multiverseid\': 288116}, {\'name\': \'Nœudebois\', \'text\': "Défense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Nœudebois.", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': "Animé par des geists fusionnés dans son écorce, il cherche d\'autres vies à incorporer dans son tronc.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7465228b-8a72-4f4c-8857-86727b2414d4\', \'multiverseId\': 287804}, \'multiverseid\': 287804}, {\'name\': \'Legnodoso\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Legnodoso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'Animato dai geist fusi nella sua quercia, brama sempre più vita da aggiungere al suo nucleo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7002ce9-ae6d-4138-a14b-a55ed19633a7\', \'multiverseId\': 288272}, \'multiverseid\': 288272}, {\'name\': \'もつれ樹\', \'text\': \'呪禁 （このクリーチャーは、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、もつれ樹の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'その樫の木は、取り憑いた霊に操られ、さらなる生命を芯に取り込もうと飢えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea6dc9ec-091f-457e-bc92-a351c829d89d\', \'multiverseId\': 288428}, \'multiverseid\': 288428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Konzentrieren\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Schätze in meinem Gedächtnis sind mit allem weltlichen Ruhm nicht aufzuwiegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51360e8d-7e7e-4d03-b612-11cecc7867f8\', \'multiverseId\': 287950}, \'multiverseid\': 287950}, {\'name\': \'Concentrarse\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El tesoro en mi mente es mayor que cualquier gloria mundana."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af7d085-2a46-46e0-af10-431057bc8728\', \'multiverseId\': 288106}, \'multiverseid\': 288106}, {\'name\': \'Concentration\', \'text\': \'Piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Je préfère les trésors de mon esprit à toutes les richesses de la terre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f763c8-5cf4-475c-9fd5-5f98a6382ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 287794}, \'multiverseid\': 287794}, {\'name\': \'Concentrare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tesoro che c\\\'è nella mia mente è più grande di tutti i beni terreni."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b72653-fb6c-430f-8042-a05e61bd7f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 288262}, \'multiverseid\': 288262}, {\'name\': \'集中\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私の心の中の宝物は、この世のどんな栄光よりも素晴らしいんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1abbf897-4631-442c-9e02-a40383dabd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 288418}, \'multiverseid\': 288418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kor-Geistertänzerin\', \'text\': \'Die Kor-Geistertänzerin erhält +2/+2 für jede an sie angelegte Aura.\\nImmer wenn du eine Aura wirkst, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Sie gelangt auch über die körperliche Ebene hinweg und kann die Ideale berühren, von denen alle Kreaturen ihre Stärke beziehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb29714-904a-4c8e-a412-69d6525f005f\', \'multiverseId\': 287887}, \'multiverseid\': 287887}, {\'name\': \'Bailarina espiritual kor\', \'text\': \'La Bailarina espiritual kor obtiene +2/+2 por cada aura anexada a ella.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de aura, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero kor\', \'flavor\': \'Alcanza más allá del reino físico, tocando los ideales de los cuales todas las criaturas obtienen su poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d019fc-990b-471d-802e-67d109463f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 288043}, \'multiverseid\': 288043}, {\'name\': "Danseuse d\'esprit kor", \'text\': "La Danseuse d\'esprit kor gagne +2/+2 pour chaque aura qui lui est attachée.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'aura, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'étire au-delà du royaume physique, touchant des idéaux d\'où toutes les créatures tirent leur puissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287731&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c08fa94-d616-4210-a3cc-e2cf60f1656b\', \'multiverseId\': 287731}, \'multiverseid\': 287731}, {\'name\': \'Danzatrice Spirituale Kor\', \'text\': \'La Danzatrice Spirituale Kor prende +2/+2 per ogni Aura a lei assegnata.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia Aura, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Kor\', \'flavor\': \'Si spinge ben oltre il reame fisico, toccando gli ideali da cui tutte le creature traggono il loro potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4bad084-f6b9-4f1b-9977-d28aedf11042\', \'multiverseId\': 288199}, \'multiverseid\': 288199}, {\'name\': \'コーの精霊の踊り手\', \'text\': \'コーの精霊の踊り手は、それにつけられているオーラ１つにつき＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがオーラ呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は物理的な境を越えて、すべての生物が力を引き出す理想に触れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b3b314-9566-4e71-86da-021fa6941232\', \'multiverseId\': 288355}, \'multiverseid\': 288355}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krond der Lichtumhüllte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Krond der Lichtumhüllte angreift und falls er dann verzaubert ist, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'Krond, die Verkörperung der Morgensonne, lebt, um Rache an seiner Erzfeindin Vela zu nehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefb328f-8ac1-4faa-b472-7dc0378d853f\', \'multiverseId\': 287866}, \'multiverseid\': 287866}, {\'name\': \'Krond, el armado con el alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nSiempre que Krond el armado con el alba ataque, si está encantado, exilia el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Krond, la personificación de la luz del alba, vive para hacer justicia sobre su némesis, Vela.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de30da6f-c1b0-47f0-8118-f9a221afd9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 288022}, \'multiverseid\': 288022}, {\'name\': "Krond à l\'Habit d\'aube", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Krond à l\'Habit d\'aube attaque, s\'il est enchanté, exilez le permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : archonte\', \'flavor\': "Krond, incarnation de la lumière de l\'aube, vit pour exercer sa justice sur Vela, sa Némésis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3006089d-754a-4d47-977e-782d79a9b85e\', \'multiverseId\': 287710}, \'multiverseid\': 287710}, {\'name\': "Krond Manto dell\'Alba", \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\nOgniqualvolta Krond Manto dell\'Alba attacca, se è incantato, esilia un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Arconte\', \'flavor\': "Krond, la personificazione della luce dell\'alba, vive per avere giustizia dalla sua nemesi Vela.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bbc4e66-278d-4a8d-ba58-d531337b993b\', \'multiverseId\': 288178}, \'multiverseid\': 288178}, {\'name\': \'暁まといのクロンド\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n暁まといのクロンドが攻撃するたび、それがエンチャントされている場合、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'暁の光の化身であるクロンドは、宿敵ヴェラに正義を成すために生きている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d9deaa-f6bb-49ec-b59a-23050e652c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 288334}, \'multiverseid\': 288334}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte und einer Ebene-Karte und bringe diese getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9909342-2427-4535-b8b8-ab746bae8961\', \'multiverseId\': 287911}, \'multiverseid\': 287911}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de bosque y una carta de llanura y ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2cd782-e199-452d-8388-590c8280a2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 288067}, \'multiverseid\': 288067}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, et mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f999c731-f3ed-4404-8d3a-09e3bd8dd1a0\', \'multiverseId\': 287755}, \'multiverseid\': 287755}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura e mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef1d66e-6739-46dc-be4e-02a82b74f107\', \'multiverseId\': 288223}, \'multiverseid\': 288223}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森カード１枚と平地カード１枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad583df-ca78-483e-9d9d-2957ca848caf\', \'multiverseId\': 288379}, \'multiverseid\': 288379}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardländern, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eines getappt ins Spiel und nimm das andere auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88cba0cc-2d34-4aff-bcae-6145dcd3c51e\', \'multiverseId\': 287925}, \'multiverseid\': 287925}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fcb7e04-fcd2-4589-85de-5163da5df150\', \'multiverseId\': 288081}, \'multiverseid\': 288081}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes et mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée, et l\'autre dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4a26b0-886c-4c60-a20f-fe9eee8ca0cb\', \'multiverseId\': 287769}, \'multiverseid\': 287769}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7adac4-e609-443f-bd02-b1016d923837\', \'multiverseId\': 288237}, \'multiverseid\': 288237}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを最大２枚まで探し、それらを公開し、１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a1042c-0d4c-4adf-967d-8dc80668b167\', \'multiverseId\': 288393}, \'multiverseid\': 288393}]', "[{'name': 'Käfig aus Händen', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\n{1}{W}: Bringe den Käfig aus Händen auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287936&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7ec86ad-7bf1-4ee9-842a-b9bd636a0bf4', 'multiverseId': 287936}, 'multiverseid': 287936}, {'name': 'Jaula de manos', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\n{1}{W}: Regresa la Jaula de manos a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288092&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd686bb83-06de-450d-9258-362d9df3591b', 'multiverseId': 288092}, 'multiverseid': 288092}, {'name': 'Cage de mains', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\n{1}{W} : Renvoyez la Cage de mains dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287780&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5297060-70c9-4dff-b681-a286fc62cbe9', 'multiverseId': 287780}, 'multiverseid': 287780}, {'name': 'Gabbia di Mani', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\n{1}{W}: Fai tornare la Gabbia di Mani in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288248&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9209bf3c-6610-4e24-a641-fdc83bc98349', 'multiverseId': 288248}, 'multiverseid': 288248}, {'name': '手の檻', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\\n{1}{W}：手の檻をオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288404&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8611d5fb-0e3e-4413-8777-f50714ef0d37', 'multiverseId': 288404}, 'multiverseid': 288404}]", '[{\'name\': \'Letztes Gefecht\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 2 Lebenspunkte pro Sumpf, den du kontrollierst. Das letzte Gefecht fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der Gebirge, die du kontrollierst, zu. Bringe für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst, einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Du erhältst für jede Ebene, die du kontrollierst, 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Ziehe eine Karte für jede Insel, die du kontrollierst und wirf dann genauso viele Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'006dbdfb-33fd-4865-905a-d1729609bcab\', \'multiverseId\': 287899}, \'multiverseid\': 287899}, {\'name\': \'Última resistencia\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo pierde 2 vidas por cada pantano que controles. La Última resistencia hace a la criatura objetivo una cantidad de daño igual al número de montañas que controles. Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1 por cada bosque que controles. Ganas 2 vidas por cada llanura que controles. Robas una carta por cada isla que controles, luego descartas ese mismo número de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d50215-38e8-42ee-a792-818e579e0e41\', \'multiverseId\': 288055}, \'multiverseid\': 288055}, {\'name\': \'Dernier carré\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé perd 2 points de vie pour chaque marais que vous contrôlez. Le Dernier carré inflige à la créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de montagnes que vous contrôlez. Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque plaine que vous contrôlez. Piochez une carte pour chaque île que vous contrôlez, puis défaussez-vous d\'autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ebdf2d9-1ca0-472d-88ea-a860f446f685\', \'multiverseId\': 287743}, \'multiverseid\': 287743}, {\'name\': \'Resistenza Estrema\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio perde 2 punti vita per ogni Palude che controlli. La Resistenza Estrema infligge danno a una creatura bersaglio pari al numero di Montagne che controlli. Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde per ogni Foresta che controlli. Guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni Pianura che controlli. Pesca una carta per ogni Isola che controlli, poi scarta altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0584b420-8684-4be2-ad15-ea490afc3bde\', \'multiverseId\': 288211}, \'multiverseid\': 288211}, {\'name\': \'最後の抵抗\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、あなたがコントロールする沼１つにつき２点のライフを失う。 クリーチャー１体を対象とする。最後の抵抗はそれに、あなたがコントロールする山の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。 あなたがコントロールする森１つにつき、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。 あなたはあなたがコントロールする平地１つにつき２点のライフを得る。 あなたがコントロールする島１つにつきカードを１枚引き、その後、その枚数のカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83df8199-0905-4946-b145-f0873bfc32a8\', \'multiverseId\': 288367}, \'multiverseid\': 288367}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lichtbogen-Spur\', \'text\': \'Die Lichtbogen-Spur fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte und einer anderen Kreatur oder einem anderen Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Versucht nicht, eure Feinde zu treffen. Konzentriert euch auf die Stellen zwischen ihnen, und füllt diese Luft mit Verderben!" —Lehre des Speerclans\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde70b9b-0ade-4c4c-be68-0e8b617ae9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 287964}, \'multiverseid\': 287964}, {\'name\': \'Rastro del arco\', \'text\': \'El Rastro del arco hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo y 1 punto de daño a otra criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No intentes golpear a tus enemigos. Concéntrate en el espacio entre ellos, y llena el aire con su perdición." —Enseñanza de la Tribu de la Lanza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb179aaa-86dc-4fe0-9d10-1e32bf52ea26\', \'multiverseId\': 288120}, \'multiverseid\': 288120}, {\'name\': "Trace d\'arc électrique", \'text\': "La Trace d\'arc électrique inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur et 1 blessure à une autre cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« N\'essayez pas de toucher vos ennemis. Concentrez-vous sur l\'espace qui les sépare et emplissez l\'air de mort. » —Enseignement de la tribu de la Haste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ad1427-8847-4e5c-b82c-47eaa556558c\', \'multiverseId\': 287808}, \'multiverseid\': 287808}, {\'name\': \'Striscia ad Arco\', \'text\': "La Striscia ad Arco infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio e 1 danno a un\'altra creatura o un altro giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non tentare di colpire i tuoi nemici. Concentrati sullo spazio che li separa e riempi l\\\'aria di distruzione." —Insegnamento della Tribù Lancia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ce5cbd-0c96-4b84-813c-312126c2267c\', \'multiverseId\': 288276}, \'multiverseid\': 288276}, {\'name\': \'電弧の痕跡\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とし、他のクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。電弧の痕跡はその前者に２点のダメージを与え、その後者に１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「敵を打とうとするな。 敵との間の空間に集中し、その間を破滅で埋めるのだ。」 ――槍族の教え\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4c94b8-4358-4ea8-8b77-d81f65ecf6bc\', \'multiverseId\': 288432}, \'multiverseid\': 288432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lilianas Specter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn Lilianas Specter ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Specter\', \'flavor\': \'„Die besten Diener wissen, was ich brauche, ohne dass ich es sagen muss." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568bcbc7-8115-4989-9a35-0a79eb5a9b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 287926}, \'multiverseid\': 287926}, {\'name\': \'Espectro de Liliana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Espectro de Liliana entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espectro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los mejores sicarios saben lo que necesito sin que tenga que decirlo." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aa48928-f8f4-49cd-b208-c4678c2613c4\', \'multiverseId\': 288082}, \'multiverseid\': 288082}, {\'name\': \'Spectre de Liliana\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Spectre de Liliana arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : spectre\', \'flavor\': "« Les meilleurs serviteurs connaissent mes désirs sans que j\'ai un mot à dire. » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d97b8a5-ddf9-45f9-ba8d-4d41e09c5b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 287770}, \'multiverseid\': 287770}, {\'name\': \'Spettro di Liliana\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando lo Spettro di Liliana entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spettro\', \'flavor\': \'"I servitori migliori sanno ciò di cui ho bisogno senza che io debba dire nulla." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab75fb6-d13b-49a5-9ba7-796a4448b4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 288238}, \'multiverseid\': 288238}, {\'name\': \'リリアナの死霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nリリアナの死霊が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スペクター\', \'flavor\': \'「最高級の下僕は、私が何も言わなくても、何が必要かわかっているものさ。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea4ec84-9a0a-475b-852c-4c23cd9fb1c0\', \'multiverseId\': 288394}, \'multiverseid\': 288394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mahlstrom-Wanderer\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nKaskade, Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Dann tust du dies noch einmal.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287854&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5ea1cd-f3c6-424f-82b4-39b2856e9de2\', \'multiverseId\': 287854}, \'multiverseid\': 287854}, {\'name\': \'Errante del Remolino\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nCascada, cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Luego hazlo nuevamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed9d48f3-37f4-49cd-a35f-7b1a6734e034\', \'multiverseId\': 288010}, \'multiverseid\': 288010}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond du maelstrom\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nCascade, cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Puis recommencez.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c907154-d9d2-46ff-ac40-bbf44a306fed\', \'multiverseId\': 287698}, \'multiverseid\': 287698}, {\'name\': \'Errante del Maelstrom\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nCascata, cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Poi fallo di nuovo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c44aa45c-ffb1-484e-8d24-4b24c575d007\', \'multiverseId\': 288166}, \'multiverseid\': 288166}, {\'name\': \'大渦の放浪者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n続唱、続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。 その後、それをもう一度行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a60fdf-cc27-42fb-8f44-04cb3da34055\', \'multiverseId\': 288322}, \'multiverseid\': 288322}]', "[{'name': 'Mantel aus Flüsterseide', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur ist unblockbar und verhüllt.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': 'Nicht nur Meuchler zahlen für diese Mäntel einen hohen Preis — sondern auch diejenigen, die sich vor Meuchlern fürchten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287930&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72452a36-ba91-46cd-8d69-ccf92a7b95ee', 'multiverseId': 287930}, 'multiverseid': 287930}, {'name': 'Manto de sedasusurrante', 'text': 'La criatura equipada es imbloqueable y tiene la habilidad de velo.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': 'Esos mantos tienen una gran demanda por los asesinos y aquellos que les temen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288086&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd4f9c22-59ae-4f27-836c-1b379ac341cc', 'multiverseId': 288086}, 'multiverseid': 288086}, {'name': 'Cape de frémisoie', 'text': 'La créature équipée est imblocable et elle a le linceul.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': 'Ces capes sont aussi populaires chez les assassins que chez leurs victimes potentielles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287774&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c32e4a0c-5ea8-4b0e-9113-3090e0a81892', 'multiverseId': 287774}, 'multiverseid': 287774}, {'name': 'Manto Setabisbiglio', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata non può essere bloccata e ha velo.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': 'Questi mantelli sono molto richiesti sia dagli assassini che da quanti li temono.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288242&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7aec524e-2181-4e3a-ba6b-0289ffa37652', 'multiverseId': 288242}, 'multiverseid': 288242}, {'name': '囁き絹の外套', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーはブロックされず、被覆を持つ。\\n装備 {2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': 'この手の外套は、暗殺者とともにそれを恐れる者たちにも大きな需要がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288398&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04a58825-5611-4068-a965-adcc695bfabc', 'multiverseId': 288398}, 'multiverseid': 288398}]", '[{\'name\': \'Maske der Fernsicht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dir Schaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen, falls die Maske der Fernsicht nicht getappt ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wandelt das Unglück der Gegenwart in Wissen auf Lebenszeit um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec111d6-bc24-465d-915c-36f67dc7efb4\', \'multiverseId\': 287973}, \'multiverseid\': 287973}, {\'name\': \'Máscara de visión distante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controle un oponente te haga daño, si la Máscara de visión distante está enderezada, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Transforma la adversidad de un momento en el conocimiento de una vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0074131-c99c-41d0-8b07-6e7c3456dcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 288129}, \'multiverseid\': 288129}, {\'name\': \'Masque de clairvoyance\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source contrôlée par un adversaire vous inflige des blessures, si le Masque de clairvoyance est dégagé, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il change l\'adversité du moment en connaissance pour toute une vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59de3ac-3ae0-4f9d-849c-33a6c79fca25\', \'multiverseId\': 287817}, \'multiverseid\': 287817}, {\'name\': \'Maschera Lungoveggente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una fonte controllata da un avversario ti infligge danno, se la Maschera Lungoveggente è STAPpata, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Trasforma le avversità del momento nella conoscenza di una vita intera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0356f3d-51de-45b8-8ebb-c7d3b70ae222\', \'multiverseId\': 288285}, \'multiverseid\': 288285}, {\'name\': \'遠見の仮面\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールする発生源１つがあなたにダメージを与えるたび、遠見の仮面がアンタップ状態である場合、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは一瞬の不幸を永遠の知識へと変える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d59210-f58d-465f-915e-d0645f801c93\', \'multiverseId\': 288441}, \'multiverseid\': 288441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Massenmeuterei\', \'text\': \'Übernimm von jedem Gegner bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert. Enttappe diese Kreaturen. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Und was sagt ihr dazu, meine getreuen Berater? ... Meine Berater?" —Edra, Meervolk-Souverän\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22d28b0-d96d-4dad-89b4-63d82357cf18\', \'multiverseId\': 287868}, \'multiverseid\': 287868}, {\'name\': \'Sedición masiva\', \'text\': \'Por cada oponente, gana el control de la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué me recomiendan, mis más leales consejeros? ...¿Consejeros?" —Edra, soberano tritón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdaea9e-8ca3-410d-87c4-6ea1e4c831dd\', \'multiverseId\': 288024}, \'multiverseid\': 288024}, {\'name\': \'Mutinerie de masse\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'en dites-vous, mes fidèles conseillers ? . . . Conseillers ? » —Edra, souveraine ondine", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2769d1-9600-4753-bd25-bda622bae369\', \'multiverseId\': 287712}, \'multiverseid\': 287712}, {\'name\': \'Ammutinamento di Massa\', \'text\': \'Per ogni avversario, prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Cosa ne dite, miei consiglieri più fidati? . . . Consiglieri?" —Edra, sovrana dei tritoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf79e2b-316c-4bcc-b96e-7d64f8bac338\', \'multiverseId\': 288180}, \'multiverseid\': 288180}, {\'name\': \'大量反逆\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人につき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。 それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。 それらはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我が最も信頼する参謀達よ、何とすべきか？ ……参謀？」 ――マーフォークの君主、エドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6ebbd9-67cf-437e-8ddf-c3650557cafc\', \'multiverseId\': 288336}, \'multiverseid\': 288336}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meucheln\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„So werden Kriege gewonnen — man braucht keine Armeen, sondern ein einfaches Messer, das man zum richtigen Zeitpunkt einsetzt." —Yurin, Meistermeuchler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fecb0f62-9611-4916-a4b0-7d0eede2ef4e\', \'multiverseId\': 287948}, \'multiverseid\': 287948}, {\'name\': \'Asesinar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo girada.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Así se ganan las guerras; no con ejércitos de soldados sino con un único cuchillo, bien colocado." —Yurin, asesino real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129d6e6a-1c4e-461a-b74f-4720b31b792e\', \'multiverseId\': 288104}, \'multiverseid\': 288104}, {\'name\': \'Meurtre\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature engagée ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est ainsi qu\'on gagne les guerres — pas avec des armées de soldats, mais avec une simple lame de couteau plantée artistiquement. » —Yurin, assassin royal", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d74ed43-49ea-43be-9832-f463a7364736\', \'multiverseId\': 287792}, \'multiverseid\': 287792}, {\'name\': \'Assassinare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura TAPpata bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Così si vincono le guerre: non con eserciti di soldati, ma con una lama affilata e piazzata ad arte." —Yurin, assassino reale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eacb3d71-74e4-4711-b2b7-2624cdb4f73f\', \'multiverseId\': 288260}, \'multiverseid\': 288260}, {\'name\': \'暗殺\', \'text\': \'タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これが戦争の勝ち方だ――軍隊の兵士じゃなく、ここぞという場所のナイフ一本でいいのさ。」 ――凄腕の暗殺者、ユリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d12a7e-7365-4a63-8ed0-10ec5634145a\', \'multiverseId\': 288416}, \'multiverseid\': 288416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitotischer Schleim\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Mitotische Schleim stirbt, bringe zwei 2/2 grüne Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, bringe zwei 1/1 grüne Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel".\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197fa9c9-ba49-4b15-8f99-89cf29b62b89\', \'multiverseId\': 287927}, \'multiverseid\': 287927}, {\'name\': \'Fango mitótico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Fango mitótico muera, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Cieno verdes 2/2. Tienen "Cuando esta criatura muera, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Cieno verdes 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f63a066-f354-4f06-b216-88b8170f6a32\', \'multiverseId\': 288083}, \'multiverseid\': 288083}, {\'name\': \'Boue mitotique\', \'text\': \'Quand la Boue mitotique meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 2/2 verte Limon. Ils ont « Quand cette créature meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte Limon. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58b693d-c83a-4e35-a2b7-f967d20db3b8\', \'multiverseId\': 287771}, \'multiverseid\': 287771}, {\'name\': \'Melma Mitotica\', \'text\': \'Quando la Melma Mitotica muore, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Melma 2/2 verdi. Hanno "Quando questa creatura muore, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Melma 1/1 verdi".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0a190a-56cd-4319-8e03-87478d976648\', \'multiverseId\': 288239}, \'multiverseid\': 288239}, {\'name\': \'分裂するスライム\', \'text\': \'分裂するスライムが死亡したとき、緑の２/２のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。 それらは「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、緑の１/１のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d1b9a20-9c37-426d-a61a-4f145dbb38ba\', \'multiverseId\': 288395}, \'multiverseid\': 288395}]', "[{'name': 'Munterer Bach', 'text': 'Der Muntere Bach kommt getappt mit zwei Ladungsmarken ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}.\\n{T}, entferne eine Ladungsmarke vom Munteren Bach: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287935&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90d00b0c-bf70-4646-8eab-fcf9336b6fd6', 'multiverseId': 287935}, 'multiverseid': 287935}, {'name': 'Arroyo vívido', 'text': 'El Arroyo vívido entra al campo de batalla girado con dos contadores de carga sobre él.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, remover un contador de carga del Arroyo vívido: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288091&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b541003d-b44a-4ee0-8057-596435f2d56d', 'multiverseId': 288091}, 'multiverseid': 288091}, {'name': 'Ruisseau éclatant', 'text': 'Le Ruisseau éclatant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé avec deux marqueurs « charge » sur lui.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur « charge » du Ruisseau éclatant : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287779&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34294c40-e0e1-425d-8361-a4746906abb0', 'multiverseId': 287779}, 'multiverseid': 287779}, {'name': 'Torrente Iridescente', 'text': 'Il Torrente Iridescente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato con due segnalini carica.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino carica dal Torrente Iridescente: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288247&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7329efb3-7e5b-4e02-bfc1-2654882ed787', 'multiverseId': 288247}, 'multiverseid': 288247}, {'name': '鮮烈な小川', 'text': '鮮烈な小川は、蓄積カウンターが２個置かれた状態で、タップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。\\n{T}, 鮮烈な小川から蓄積カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288403&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '488b8a91-91f5-4184-91e0-70412db96226', 'multiverseId': 288403}, 'multiverseid': 288403}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mykoloth\', \'text\': \'Verschlingen 2 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit doppelt so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nBringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments für jede +1/+1-Marke auf dem Mykoloth einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e407dbf6-5f9a-41de-b92f-3ac7984418f4\', \'multiverseId\': 287896}, \'multiverseid\': 287896}, {\'name\': \'Micolot\', \'text\': \'Devorar 2. (En cuanto esto entra al campo de batalla puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con el doble esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1 por cada contador +1/+1 sobre el Micolot.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35bad573-d533-4581-a854-5f6efae0e93b\', \'multiverseId\': 288052}, \'multiverseid\': 288052}, {\'name\': \'Mycoloth\', \'text\': \'Dévorement 2 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier le nombre de créatures de votre choix. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur le Mycoloth.\', \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f56ac667-ab44-4d41-9a8f-f2484a039372\', \'multiverseId\': 287740}, \'multiverseid\': 287740}, {\'name\': \'Fungoloth\', \'text\': "Divorare 2 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Entra nel campo di battaglia con il doppio di segnalini +1/+1.)\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde per ogni segnalino +1/+1 sul Fungoloth.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db618c58-e5e0-4917-83ec-c83a195a59ee\', \'multiverseId\': 288208}, \'multiverseid\': 288208}, {\'name\': \'マイコロス\', \'text\': \'貪食 ２ （これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。 このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の２倍に等しい＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、マイコロスの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df4be76-75a4-4983-955d-169167610fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 288364}, \'multiverseid\': 288364}]', "[{'name': 'Nebelklingen-Shinobi', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {U} ({U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Nebelklingen-Shinobi einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287915&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e5d4edb-bc1b-4657-bf07-810a07a7c8f6', 'multiverseId': 287915}, 'multiverseid': 287915}, {'name': 'Shinobi hojaniebla', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {U}. ({U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Shinobi hojaniebla haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes regresar la criatura objetivo que controle ese jugador a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288071&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5e93b1c-f0b4-4ea7-9308-fa88030cd147', 'multiverseId': 288071}, 'multiverseid': 288071}, {'name': 'Shinobi brumelame', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {U} ({U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Shinobi brumelame inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez renvoyer la créature ciblée contrôlée par ce joueur dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287759&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90477eeb-b766-4ca4-9594-fc001d829692', 'multiverseId': 287759}, 'multiverseid': 287759}, {'name': 'Shinobi Foscalama', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {U} ({U}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta lo Shinobi Foscalama infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi far tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288227&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95d1ffca-a162-4426-9351-32bbfd594127', 'multiverseId': 288227}, 'multiverseid': 288227}, {'name': '霧刃の忍び', 'text': '忍術 {U} （{U}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n霧刃の忍びがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288383&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a71cf42-fe79-48ba-9c8f-eb1e08737ec0', 'multiverseId': 288383}, 'multiverseid': 288383}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nest-Eindringling\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Nest-Eindringling ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 0/1 farblosen (Eldrazi, Ausgeburt)-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}".\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Er ist der Nährboden der glorreichen Zukunft seines Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fee3080-05a0-406e-91a8-53562269106c\', \'multiverseId\': 287971}, \'multiverseid\': 287971}, {\'name\': \'Invasor del nido\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Invasor del nido entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incolora 0/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Nutre el glorioso futuro de sus amos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c19ac1d-c409-443e-ae7a-c100251d700e\', \'multiverseId\': 288127}, \'multiverseid\': 288127}, {\'name\': \'Envahisseur de nid\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Envahisseur de nid arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 0/1 incolore Eldrazi et Engeance. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Il soigne l\'avenir glorieux de ses maîtres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62948831-dd15-4c40-bdfe-4a256661a8e5\', \'multiverseId\': 287815}, \'multiverseid\': 287815}, {\'name\': \'Invasore della Colonia\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Invasore della Colonia entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Progenie Eldrazi 0/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Alimenta il glorioso futuro dei suoi padroni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1806298-b535-48c5-8660-a4aa6e96f57c\', \'multiverseId\': 288283}, \'multiverseid\': 288283}, {\'name\': \'巣の侵略者\', \'text\': \'巣の侵略者が戦場に出たとき、無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。 それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'それは造物主の輝かしき未来を育む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1c7110-9532-436a-9675-f183ddd12d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 288439}, \'multiverseid\': 288439}]', "[{'name': 'Ninja der späten Stunden', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Ninja der späten Stunden einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287916&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba84da08-6048-45d3-ac9e-5ffcf66e9194', 'multiverseId': 287916}, 'multiverseid': 287916}, {'name': 'Ninja de las horas tardías', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Ninja de las horas tardías haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288072&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dc1444c-53fd-4898-83ea-f81ec0c3abdf', 'multiverseId': 288072}, 'multiverseid': 288072}, {'name': 'Ninja des heures noires', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ninja des heures noires inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287760&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e6a73cf-056f-4916-b4c7-4a431f916c27', 'multiverseId': 287760}, 'multiverseid': 287760}, {'name': 'Ninja della Notte Fonda', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Ninja della Notte Fonda infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288228&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6c03786-9106-4506-843f-6c9d89612bf4', 'multiverseId': 288228}, 'multiverseid': 288228}, {'name': '深き刻の忍者', 'text': '忍術 {1}{U} （{1}{U}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n深き刻の忍者がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288384&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c556115a-e5b3-4e60-a610-40c8e7f5b645', 'multiverseId': 288384}, 'multiverseid': 288384}]", '[{\'name\': \'Noggele-Einsacker\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Noggele-Einsacker ins Spiel kommt, zieht jeder Spieler zwei Karten und wirft dann eine zufällig bestimmte Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Noggele, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Noggele leben nur von dem, was sie erbeuten können. Ein Noggele isst nichts, trägt nichts und benutzt nichts, das nicht vorher schon jemandem anderen gehörte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f452b864-b090-4d92-8cea-572c67f241e7\', \'multiverseId\': 287881}, \'multiverseid\': 287881}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador noggle\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Saqueador noggle entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador roba dos cartas, luego descarta una carta al azar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón noggle\', \'flavor\': \'Los noggles viven solamente de lo que pueden carroñear. No hay nada que un noggle coma, vista o use que no haya pertenecido a alguien antes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62777345-8219-43c2-8ef6-81c8619753a3\', \'multiverseId\': 288037}, \'multiverseid\': 288037}, {\'name\': \'Saccageur neugle\', \'text\': "Quand le Saccageur neugle arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur pioche deux cartes, puis se défausse d\'une carte au hasard.", \'type\': \'Créature : neugle et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les neugles vivent en fonction de ce qu\'ils peuvent récupérer. Rien de ce qu\'un neugle mange, porte ou utilise n\'a pas déjà appartenu à quelqu\'un d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287725&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95cefca7-3cbc-4a52-b6e7-3ce6a059fc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 287725}, \'multiverseid\': 287725}, {\'name\': \'Noggle Saccheggiatore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Noggle Saccheggiatore entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta a caso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Noggle\', \'flavor\': \'I noggle vivono solamente di quello che riescono a scovare. Non esiste una sola cosa che un noggle mangia, indossa o usa che un tempo non appartenesse a qualcun altro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d687e2c-3a03-4bb9-b8a8-f5fa2077a5a0\', \'multiverseId\': 288193}, \'multiverseid\': 288193}, {\'name\': \'ノッグルの荒らし屋\', \'text\': \'ノッグルの荒らし屋が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはカードを２枚引き、その後カードを１枚無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ノッグル・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'ノッグルは純粋に自分たちが漁れる物だけで生きている。 ノッグルが食べたり着たり使ったりするものの中で、誰かの物ではなかった物はひとつも無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19a3bfa-5879-4cd3-b8cd-3692e62eb07a\', \'multiverseId\': 288349}, \'multiverseid\': 288349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ondu-Riese\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ondu-Riese ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, diese getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Druiden lassen Gärten erblühen. Andere ganze Kontinente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77bbd24d-e789-4fd6-a759-7c1a493769cd\', \'multiverseId\': 287889}, \'multiverseid\': 287889}, {\'name\': \'Gigante de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gigante de Ondu entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos druidas cultivan jardines. Otros cultivan continentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343ee4df-0872-4969-b07e-124ea429e21a\', \'multiverseId\': 288045}, \'multiverseid\': 288045}, {\'name\': \'Géant du Ondou\', \'text\': \'Quand le Géant du Ondou arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant et druide\', \'flavor\': "Certains druides entretiennent des jardins. D\'autres entretiennent des continents.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a24c0c55-5b9b-48d9-87a1-dc3b9688eca2\', \'multiverseId\': 287733}, \'multiverseid\': 287733}, {\'name\': \'Gigante di Ondu\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gigante di Ondu entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni druidi coltivano giardini. Altri interi continenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8c38b0-e0ae-4a9e-aa1e-c27c9daf6aec\', \'multiverseId\': 288201}, \'multiverseid\': 288201}, {\'name\': \'オンドゥの巨人\', \'text\': \'オンドゥの巨人が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'ドルイドは庭を育む。 中には大陸を育む者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7626ca5b-5072-44c6-8653-2b60f26ae899\', \'multiverseId\': 288357}, \'multiverseid\': 288357}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oni der lautlosen Klinge\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Oni der lautlosen Klinge einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand dieses Spielers an. Du kannst eine Karte darunter, die kein Land ist, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'702cb9ac-ceb6-40c8-b6d0-6696989a4b61\', \'multiverseId\': 287861}, \'multiverseid\': 287861}, {\'name\': \'Oni hoja silenciosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B}. ({4}{U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Oni hoja silenciosa haga daño de combate a un jugador, mira la mano de ese jugador. Puedes lanzar una carta que no sea tierra de allí sin pagar el coste de maná de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09581b5-43d2-4b17-ba57-95059314fa7d\', \'multiverseId\': 288017}, \'multiverseid\': 288017}, {\'name\': \'Oni à la lame silencieuse\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Oni à la lame silencieuse inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la main de ce joueur. Vous pouvez lancer une carte non-terrain qui s\'y trouve sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287705&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a4db09-fddc-441d-983f-a0f9e2f67c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 287705}, \'multiverseid\': 287705}, {\'name\': \'Oni Lama Silenziosa\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Oni Lama Silenziosa infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, guarda la mano di quel giocatore. Puoi lanciare una carta non terra da quella mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'705fe2b0-9972-4d09-85a9-843c61831dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 288173}, \'multiverseid\': 288173}, {\'name\': \'静刃の鬼\', \'text\': \'忍術 {4}{U}{B} （{4}{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n静刃の鬼がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーの手札を見る。 あなたはその中の土地でないカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af80d588-f1d1-4c81-90fe-3f7ca7e3e286\', \'multiverseId\': 288329}, \'multiverseid\': 288329}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pechhaltiger Strahl\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nDer Pechhaltige Strahl fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb09430d-7715-4822-8617-e44ca9065d95\', \'multiverseId\': 287901}, \'multiverseid\': 287901}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga bituminosa\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nLa Ráfaga bituminosa hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75c7b47c-90b3-483e-a6fc-1d80aac64d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 288057}, \'multiverseid\': 288057}, {\'name\': \'Salve bitumeuse\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLa Salve bitumeuse inflige 4 blessures à la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bd8622-5c2d-4ef3-bb5a-d2596178c3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 287745}, \'multiverseid\': 287745}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione di Bitume\', \'text\': "Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nL\'Esplosione di Bitume infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6c1a34-ab4d-431b-b381-7f47ca3d00de\', \'multiverseId\': 288213}, \'multiverseid\': 288213}, {\'name\': \'瀝青破\', \'text\': \'続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。瀝青破はそれに4点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fd834a4-9e1a-476b-a681-3dc9420bb1a8\', \'multiverseId\': 288369}, \'multiverseid\': 288369}]', "[{'name': 'Pollenbenetzte Flügel', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bringe genauso viele 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287941&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '888964a6-4763-417b-a8f8-10283be2225f', 'multiverseId': 287941}, 'multiverseid': 287941}, {'name': 'Alas de polenbrillante', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon en el campo de batalla esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288097&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f330daa3-99da-4802-8c91-93b8021f577b', 'multiverseId': 288097}, 'multiverseid': 288097}, {'name': 'Ailes de clairpollen', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez sur le champ de bataille autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287785&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa170dd7-ae8d-40e1-8e7d-78b6aa127f0d', 'multiverseId': 287785}, 'multiverseid': 287785}, {'name': 'Ali Splendipolline', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha volare.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti sul campo di battaglia altrettante pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288253&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14352420-7132-4516-9e2f-71f0d03eaf32', 'multiverseId': 288253}, 'multiverseid': 288253}, {'name': '花粉光の羽', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを戦場に出す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288409&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1d9c7a0-12d4-4c87-af5f-5a5017675104', 'multiverseId': 288409}, 'multiverseid': 288409}]", '[{\'name\': \'Realität leugnen\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nBringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c95b71b-7bec-40f9-ba86-9438e460316c\', \'multiverseId\': 287903}, \'multiverseid\': 287903}, {\'name\': \'Negar la realidad\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nRegresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a57da264-42bc-4a37-8087-83b9f0316748\', \'multiverseId\': 288059}, \'multiverseid\': 288059}, {\'name\': \'Déni de réalité\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nRenvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b36fb8-74c1-4f8e-8937-8dc1c5839889\', \'multiverseId\': 287747}, \'multiverseid\': 287747}, {\'name\': \'Negare la Realtà\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nFai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098fa80b-5cd4-4730-9561-b37acb8ca7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 288215}, \'multiverseid\': 288215}, {\'name\': \'現実の否定\', \'text\': \'続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\\nパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d26344-a468-425e-b1b1-dbe67c723a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 288371}, \'multiverseid\': 288371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rätsel-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Rätsel-Sphinx aus dem Spiel auf den Friedhof gelegt wird, lege sie als dritte Karte von oben in deine Bibliothek.\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke solange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die weniger kostet als diese und die kein Land ist. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad639a6b-4707-4f7f-9224-c399fae4ac6d\', \'multiverseId\': 287904}, \'multiverseid\': 287904}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge del enigma\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Esfinge del enigma vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, ponla en la parte superior tu biblioteca en tercer lugar.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'120b2bb9-ee7a-4aab-86fc-07a7cfea3f28\', \'multiverseId\': 288060}, \'multiverseid\': 288060}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx du logogriphe\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Sphinx du logogriphe est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, mettez-le en troisième position au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7f59053-22db-47ee-9203-17b448f4253f\', \'multiverseId\': 287748}, \'multiverseid\': 287748}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge degli Enigmi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Sfinge degli Enigmi viene messa nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, mettila come terza carta dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1255d88d-bac4-4f61-af92-5d6803f00b99\', \'multiverseId\': 288216}, \'multiverseid\': 288216}, {\'name\': \'謎のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n謎のスフィンクスが戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれたとき、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚目に置く。\\n続唱 （あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを、コストがより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで追放する。 あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f4edb2-37b7-48a4-888c-249ebd77a560\', \'multiverseId\': 288372}, \'multiverseid\': 288372}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sai des Shinobis\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du das Sai des Shinobis an diese Kreatur anlegen.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Übergabe des Sais ist ein Zeichen für den Niedergang des alten Clans und für das Aufsteigen des neuen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a017b6b-5555-4bf3-ac79-758a41268b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 287863}, \'multiverseid\': 287863}, {\'name\': \'Sai de los shinobi\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes anexarle el Sai de los shinobi.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'El pasaje del sai presagia el final del viejo clan y el ascenso del nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8617bd0-43e4-4e50-8a15-8cd217a59622\', \'multiverseId\': 288019}, \'multiverseid\': 288019}, {\'name\': \'Sai du shinobi\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez lui attacher le Sai du shinobi.\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Le don du sai présage la fin de l\'ancien clan et l\'ascension du nouveau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53e413d8-5e02-426b-9e9f-e46d259db5b2\', \'multiverseId\': 287707}, \'multiverseid\': 287707}, {\'name\': \'Sai dello Shinobi\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi assegnarle il Sai dello Shinobi.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Il passaggio del sai fa presagire la fine del vecchio clan e l\'ascesa del nuovo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317c7da7-4c34-4d4d-97df-eeaca1f26e16\', \'multiverseId\': 288175}, \'multiverseid\': 288175}, {\'name\': \'忍びの釵\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは忍びの釵をそれにつけてもよい。\\n装備 {2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'この釵を渡すことは、古き一族の終焉と、新しきものの昇進を示す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592710b1-c0ba-49e7-9bad-b4ba72779623\', \'multiverseId\': 288331}, \'multiverseid\': 288331}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sakashimas Lehrling\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nDu kannst Sakashimas Lehrling als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Kreaturentypen weiterhin auch ein Ninja ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287857&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59540922-ed39-4466-aa3b-5bff9cc29e02\', \'multiverseId\': 287857}, \'multiverseid\': 287857}, {\'name\': \'Estudiante de Sakashima\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nPuedes hacer que el Estudiante de Sakashima entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que sigue siendo un Ninja además de sus otros tipos de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05fc9542-729b-4b22-8d55-d395a02e0936\', \'multiverseId\': 288013}, \'multiverseid\': 288013}, {\'name\': \'Élève de Sakashima\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nVous pouvez faire que l\'Élève de Sakashima arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est toujours un ninja en plus de ses autres types de créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287701&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c02d07-304b-4f38-af5c-63d6f712e076\', \'multiverseId\': 287701}, \'multiverseid\': 287701}, {\'name\': \'Studente di Sakashima\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nPuoi far entrare lo Studente di Sakashima nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che è ancora un Ninja in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi di creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0973b9-3dc2-4922-b06a-a1c2b6918e39\', \'multiverseId\': 288169}, \'multiverseid\': 288169}, {\'name\': \'逆嶋の学徒\', \'text\': \'忍術 {1}{U} （{1}{U}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\nあなたは逆嶋の学徒を、それが他のクリーチャー・タイプに加えて忍者であることを除き、戦場に出ているいずれかのクリーチャーのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b2726c3-8e69-48ad-b75a-1c94e4825e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 288325}, \'multiverseid\': 288325}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafte Hyäne\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und Erstschlag.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083f2fe3-5874-4b74-958f-33868c1d5345\', \'multiverseId\': 287886}, \'multiverseid\': 287886}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de hiena\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eeca14d-5259-4e63-ba9e-0ede15dbf6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 288042}, \'multiverseid\': 288042}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de hyène\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a l\'initiative.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287730&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68fd61d7-df62-47f3-a655-b01e92fd05af\', \'multiverseId\': 287730}, \'multiverseid\': 287730}, {\'name\': \'Essenza della Iena\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha attacco improvviso.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73213668-5df4-4da2-bd25-116bcfed1c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 288198}, \'multiverseid\': 288198}, {\'name\': \'ハイエナの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持つ。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4998faf3-fb94-45d8-b7ad-1de28954aba3\', \'multiverseId\': 288354}, \'multiverseid\': 288354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafte Ophis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen".\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f3e3f6b-9669-45be-ae52-bca46eb27521\', \'multiverseId\': 287891}, \'multiverseid\': 287891}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de víbora\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño a un oponente, puedes robar una carta".\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c014a03c-a36b-44c5-ba0d-afc24acb6caa\', \'multiverseId\': 288047}, \'multiverseid\': 288047}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de serpent\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et elle a « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous pouvez piocher une carte. »\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16cccd6-6b64-4006-a4a0-3ed71533c4be\', \'multiverseId\': 287735}, \'multiverseid\': 287735}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Serpente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno a un avversario, puoi pescare una carta".\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\\\'Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84751440-f11a-47c7-b4a0-bf805bbc931d\', \'multiverseId\': 288203}, \'multiverseid\': 288203}, {\'name\': \'蛇の陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに「このクリーチャーがいずれかの対戦相手にダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。」を持つ。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c887c226-5797-416e-b943-fc62cd6387f5\', \'multiverseId\': 288359}, \'multiverseid\': 288359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafte Raubkatze\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Lebensverknüpfung.\\n{1}{W}: Lege die Schattenhafte Raubkatze an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14ecc6c-e9ef-43ca-b09c-57fe03869b40\', \'multiverseId\': 287865}, \'multiverseid\': 287865}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de felidar\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital.\\n{1}{W}: Anexa la Umbra de felidar a la criatura objetivo que controles.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc821ac-3ee2-4301-a8f1-24a3017e6c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 288021}, \'multiverseid\': 288021}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de félidar\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a le lien de vie.\\n{1}{W} : Attachez l\'Ombre de félidar à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291a8ed8-e5d0-4f44-9615-c9651373fa28\', \'multiverseId\': 287709}, \'multiverseid\': 287709}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Felidar\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha legame vitale.\\n{1}{W}: Assegna l\'Essenza del Felidar a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd966b6-2c07-46eb-a9ad-29961e5a1598\', \'multiverseId\': 288177}, \'multiverseid\': 288177}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、フェリダーの陰影をそれにつける。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e66cfa-0cc4-4114-b365-e268786d969e\', \'multiverseId\': 288333}, \'multiverseid\': 288333}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Keiler\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Von hier aus sieht alles wie eine Mahlzeit aus."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4f1db1-90a5-4b97-98ff-8c7ef222fcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 287885}, \'multiverseid\': 287885}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de jabalí\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Desde aquí dentro, todo parece una cena."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac32ff9-1aee-4996-9598-aa778a45c963\', \'multiverseId\': 288041}, \'multiverseid\': 288041}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de sanglier\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Vu d\'ici, tout a l\'air d\'un dîner. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2719768d-b837-4151-ba3a-e79c46e63c27\', \'multiverseId\': 287729}, \'multiverseid\': 287729}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Cinghiale\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Da qua dentro tutto sembra commestibile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee86122-8585-4a16-95c4-a4ae29607435\', \'multiverseId\': 288197}, \'multiverseid\': 288197}, {\'name\': \'猪の陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「この中からだと、全部が晩飯に見えるな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ce25e0-92c4-4784-b579-66d2ba40af2a\', \'multiverseId\': 288353}, \'multiverseid\': 288353}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhaftes Indrik\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+4 und Erstschlag, und alle Kreaturen, die in der Lage sind, sie zu blocken, tun dies.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287858&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4adb533-7000-498e-8083-434440cbb53c\', \'multiverseId\': 287858}, \'multiverseid\': 287858}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de indrik\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+4 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero, y todas las criaturas que puedan bloquearla lo hacen.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7159595-451f-424b-8ccf-575d94ac5df4\', \'multiverseId\': 288014}, \'multiverseid\': 288014}, {\'name\': "Ombre d\'indrik", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+4, elle a l\'initiative et toutes les créatures capables de la bloquer le font.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287702&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d0dcd96-ac48-4228-a099-3a1e7ee66ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 287702}, \'multiverseid\': 287702}, {\'name\': "Essenza dell\'Indrik", \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+4 e ha attacco improvviso, e tutte le creature in grado di bloccarla lo fanno.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ef5114-ceb2-49a5-960d-9af694f7c800\', \'multiverseId\': 288170}, \'multiverseid\': 288170}, {\'name\': \'インドリクの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋４の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持ち、それをブロックできるすべてのクリーチャーはそれをブロックする。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a25cca-004e-4219-8680-880ff0d1bc81\', \'multiverseId\': 288326}, \'multiverseid\': 288326}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhaftes Mammut\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14717ab-b5ef-4ce9-aa16-8d16b4801898\', \'multiverseId\': 287888}, \'multiverseid\': 287888}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de mamut\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye este aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fef30b1-7dc2-45da-9452-d6f32c7feea4\', \'multiverseId\': 288044}, \'multiverseid\': 288044}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de mammouth\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 et a la vigilance.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb17125e-eaca-4582-820d-82370344516a\', \'multiverseId\': 287732}, \'multiverseid\': 287732}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Mammut\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3 e ha cautela.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5c1feb-badb-4d30-aa28-827014d1ab70\', \'multiverseId\': 288200}, \'multiverseid\': 288200}, {\'name\': \'マンモスの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともに警戒を持つ。\\n族霊鎧 （エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊される場合、代わりにそれからすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f70a99f-090c-4a73-93be-6152cbc0f933\', \'multiverseId\': 288356}, \'multiverseid\': 288356}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schimmernde Grotte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist der Preis dafür, der letzte in der Nahrungskette zu sein. Wir müssen unsere schönsten Orte versteckt halten, statt sie allen vorzuzeigen." —Hildin, Priesterin von Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4caa4366-dd4a-401e-aaa4-8cc33e9c7284\', \'multiverseId\': 287934}, \'multiverseid\': 287934}, {\'name\': \'Gruta resplandeciente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Este es el precio de ser el último en la cadena alimenticia.. Debemos mantener nuestros lugares hermosos escondidos en lugar de mostrarlos." —Hildin, sacerdote de Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c6aa7b-352c-4680-ad5a-32a820d646e7\', \'multiverseId\': 288090}, \'multiverseid\': 288090}, {\'name\': \'Grotte chatoyante\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est le prix d\'être en dernière place de la chaîne alimentaire. Nous devons cacher nos lieux de beauté au lieu de les révéler aux yeux de tous. » —Hildin, prêtresse d\'Avacyn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2bde93-95bf-406b-83a3-57e641c5ba33\', \'multiverseId\': 287778}, \'multiverseid\': 287778}, {\'name\': \'Grotta Scintillante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo è il prezzo che si paga a essere in fondo alla catena alimentare. Dobbiamo tenere nascoste le nostre bellezze naturali invece di metterle in mostra." —Hildin, sacerdotessa di Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78fa1f60-a176-450a-b089-1c2ff29e4a56\', \'multiverseId\': 288246}, \'multiverseid\': 288246}, {\'name\': \'ゆらめく岩屋\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「これが食物連鎖の最後にいる代償です。 美しい場所は全てに見せるのではなく、隠しておかなければなりません。」 ――アヴァシンの僧侶、ヒルディン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2bb5226-9b19-4554-b9c1-c744a3605cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 288402}, \'multiverseid\': 288402}]', "[{'name': 'Schinderhülle', 'text': 'Lebende Waffe (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 0/0 schwarzen Keim-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287882&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '922c725b-4039-44ec-83df-b6f4621fed27', 'multiverseId': 287882}, 'multiverseid': 287882}, {'name': 'Caparazón desollador', 'text': 'Arma viviente. (Cuando este equipo entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura negra Germen 0/0, luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288038&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d912dab-116b-4504-846f-598cdc7f4eac', 'multiverseId': 288038}, 'multiverseid': 288038}, {'name': 'Carapace écorcheuse', 'text': 'Arme vivante (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Germe, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287726&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c522c7b-315d-4e3b-a3d7-f6ba4055828c', 'multiverseId': 287726}, 'multiverseid': 287726}, {'name': 'Guscio dello Scorticatore', 'text': 'Arma vivente (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Microbo 0/0 nera, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288194&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b305ec6-9bf0-471f-809b-303b70da6dca', 'multiverseId': 288194}, 'multiverseid': 288194}, {'name': '皮剥ぎの鞘', 'text': '生体武器 （この装備品が戦場に出たとき、黒の０/０の細菌・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出し、その後これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備 {2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288350&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20e9df43-0925-417a-a708-cf848b544a9e', 'multiverseId': 288350}, 'multiverseid': 288350}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schlammknopf-Fackelläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schlammknopf-Fackelläufer stirbt, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Das Öl schwappt auf seinen Schädel, während er sich seinem Ziel nähert: dem Froschwerfer-Wettbewerb und dem Entzünden des flammenden Boggarts.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a64dba-359c-430d-b87e-29cff3f11ea1\', \'multiverseId\': 287951}, \'multiverseid\': 287951}, {\'name\': \'Antorchero de Botón Fangoso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Antorchero de Botón Fangoso muera, le hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El aceite golpea contra su cabeza mientras se acerca a su destino: los juegos de lanzamiento de rana y el encendido del Boggart llameante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e711e14-a339-446a-8fd5-a05aad47a4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 288107}, \'multiverseid\': 288107}, {\'name\': \'Porteur de torche de Baugebouton\', \'text\': \'Quand le Porteur de torche de Baugebouton meurt, il inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "L\'huile coule sur son crâne tandis qu\'il approche de sa destination : l\'ouverture des Jeux de lancer de grenouilles et l\'allumage du Boggart de Feu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f5fcce-be09-41d2-9cc8-67b50054c100\', \'multiverseId\': 287795}, \'multiverseid\': 287795}, {\'name\': \'Tedoforo di Bottone Fangoso\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tedoforo di Bottone Fangoso muore, infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "L\'olio gli sciaborda sul cranio mentre si avvicina alla meta: i Giochi del Lancio della Rana e l\'accensione del Boggart Infuocato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab96466-b493-444b-8070-ba6123a274dd\', \'multiverseId\': 288263}, \'multiverseid\': 288263}, {\'name\': \'泥デコの松明走り\', \'text\': \'泥デコの松明走りが死亡したとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。泥デコの松明走りはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'蛙投げ遊びと燃えボガートの点火という目的地に近づくにつれ、彼の頭の油はさらに波打った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b739c530-726f-49fe-b26c-c30302210904\', \'multiverseId\': 288419}, \'multiverseid\': 288419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schädelschnapper\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {B} ({B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Schädelschnapper einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof dieses Spielers ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56dd4430-5bdd-416c-ba6e-2fd889983405\', \'multiverseId\': 287918}, \'multiverseid\': 287918}, {\'name\': \'Secuestracráneos\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {B}. ({B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Secuestracráneos haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia hasta dos cartas objetivo del cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105f37f6-8c53-4937-bf92-5e21611787cf\', \'multiverseId\': 288074}, \'multiverseid\': 288074}, {\'name\': \'Profanateur de crâne\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {B} ({B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Profanateur de crâne inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées du cimetière de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : rat et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6188203-0302-40b8-b21f-694b71b69869\', \'multiverseId\': 287762}, \'multiverseid\': 287762}, {\'name\': \'Razziateschio\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {B} ({B}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Razziateschio infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia fino a due carte bersaglio dal cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Ratto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2959d111-5868-4f5e-9c8d-cdbb3292a89c\', \'multiverseId\': 288230}, \'multiverseid\': 288230}, {\'name\': \'骨奪い\', \'text\': \'忍術 {B} （{B}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n骨奪いがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるカードを最大２枚まで対象とする。あなたはそれらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f596e61d-a7e0-4e5e-a786-67fc663ee7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 288386}, \'multiverseid\': 288386}]', "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Heiligtum', 'text': 'Das Selesnija-Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Selesnija-Heiligtum ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287942&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '204cda0c-9243-46b8-8b45-7529836b7fdb', 'multiverseId': 287942}, 'multiverseid': 287942}, {'name': 'Santuario Selesnya', 'text': 'El Santuario Selesnya entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Santuario selesnya entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controles a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{W} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288098&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d12abf8-b873-455e-994e-2c84fc1d12ea', 'multiverseId': 288098}, 'multiverseid': 288098}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire de Selesnya', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{W} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287786&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05da5880-7447-4109-8ec2-4d854d8e72fb', 'multiverseId': 287786}, 'multiverseid': 287786}, {'name': 'Santuario di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{W} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288254&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adb3642a-e6fa-4b6a-8d25-58e4e5e49554', 'multiverseId': 288254}, 'multiverseid': 288254}, {'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地を１つオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b29f535d-5aae-441d-b8f6-0e0df3587e8a', 'multiverseId': 288410}, 'multiverseid': 288410}]", "[{'name': 'Shinobi der Okiba-Bande', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Shinobi der Okiba-Bande einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft dieser Spieler zwei Karten aus seiner Hand ab.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ratte, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287917&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '130e870d-e2ad-4f62-a7b1-cbe677b767db', 'multiverseId': 287917}, 'multiverseid': 287917}, {'name': 'Shinobi de la banda Okiba', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {3}{B}. ({3}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controles a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Shinobi de la banda Okiba haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador descarta dos cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja rata', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288073&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbdef5a1-4af4-4e7a-8e18-7645a0cbccf3', 'multiverseId': 288073}, 'multiverseid': 288073}, {'name': 'Shinobi du gang Okiba', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Shinobi du gang Okiba inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur se défausse de deux cartes.', 'type': 'Créature : rat et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287761&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0afb168a-baff-4fbb-9581-867e98efe11f', 'multiverseId': 287761}, 'multiverseid': 287761}, {'name': 'Shinobi della Banda Okiba', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, Riprendi in mano una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta lo Shinobi della Banda Okiba infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore scarta due carte.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Ratto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288229&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe54de09-0c15-4715-b86a-623a43d885ec', 'multiverseId': 288229}, 'multiverseid': 288229}, {'name': '大牙の衆の忍び', 'text': '忍術 {3}{B} （{3}{B}, あなたがコントロールするブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態の攻撃クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。）\\n大牙の衆の忍びがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ネズミ・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288385&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83d7fa0c-e7fb-4cf1-acf7-cd30166a2308', 'multiverseId': 288385}, 'multiverseid': 288385}]", '[{\'name\': \'Siegel des leeren Throns\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, bringe einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Als Asha Bant verließ, stellte sie sicher, dass die Welt auch in ihrer Abwesenheit Schutz und Ordnung haben würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af38528a-7005-4632-981e-18a0e6bab032\', \'multiverseId\': 287968}, \'multiverseid\': 287968}, {\'name\': \'Sello del trono vacío\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Asha dejó Bant, se aseguró de que el mundo tuviera protección y orden en su ausencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6862f3-ff82-426a-871c-79f08f8d1394\', \'multiverseId\': 288124}, \'multiverseid\': 288124}, {\'name\': \'Sigille du trône vacant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Quand Asha quitta Bant, elle s\'assura que le monde connaîtrait ordre et protection en son absence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1194d9e9-fcd6-45fd-897a-cf4cb124edf4\', \'multiverseId\': 287812}, \'multiverseid\': 287812}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo del Trono Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Asha lasciò Bant, si assicurò che il mondo potesse beneficiare di ordine e protezione anche durante la sua assenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb40453-251d-48b9-b720-20a6375a4206\', \'multiverseId\': 288280}, \'multiverseid\': 288280}, {\'name\': \'空位の玉座の印章\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント呪文を１つ唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アーシャはバントを離れる際に、彼女がいない間もこの世界に守護と秩序が失われないようにした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f96e34-d012-4e4b-b90b-eb2018ba5c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 288436}, \'multiverseid\': 288436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silhana-Simskletterin\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nDie Silhana-Simskletterin kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Leute auf der Straße nennen sie „Dachmäuse", aber hinter der Neckerei steckt ein unausgesprochener Neid auf das Können der Simskletterer, jedem Ärger aus dem Weg zu gehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97f72c5-d8bb-4d80-95f1-acfcedeeba38\', \'multiverseId\': 287957}, \'multiverseid\': 287957}, {\'name\': \'Andarepisa silhana\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\\nLa Andarepisa silhana no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón elfo\', \'flavor\': \'En las calles los llaman "ratones de torres", pero las burlas esconden la envidia contenida por la habilidad de los andarepisa para evitar el daño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2039fb9f-691a-4da7-ac5b-626087f1cdb7\', \'multiverseId\': 288113}, \'multiverseid\': 288113}, {\'name\': \'Marchesaillie silhana\', \'text\': \'Défense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nLa Marchesaillie silhana ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Les gens de la rue les appellent « les souris des tours, » mais en fait, ils envient cette incroyable aptitude des marchesaillies à rester en vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4543453-cfed-40d3-962d-a76b9607abfb\', \'multiverseId\': 287801}, \'multiverseid\': 287801}, {\'name\': \'Calcasporgenze Silhana\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\nLa Calcasporgenze Silhana non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'La gente di strada li chiama "topi delle guglie", ma dietro allo scherno si nasconde una tacita invidia nei confronti dell\\\'abilità dei calcasporgenze a evitare di farsi male.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45dac4a9-34c1-4eb8-9a3d-730641aff54f\', \'multiverseId\': 288269}, \'multiverseid\': 288269}, {\'name\': \'シラナの岩礁渡り\', \'text\': \'呪禁 （このクリーチャーは、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nシラナの岩礁渡りは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'町の人々は彼らを「尖塔ネズミ」と呼んでいるが、その嘲りの影には、災害を避ける技を持つ岩礁渡りに対する声に出されない羨みがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fd0a81-f6da-4333-9223-65ca23b593a9\', \'multiverseId\': 288425}, \'multiverseid\': 288425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skarrg, die Gruben des Zorns\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{R}{G}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 und verursacht bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Palast soll unser Feuertopf sein, und es gibt gerösteten Prinz als Siegermahl. Schickt die Flammenschweine rein!" —Ghut Rak, Gruul-Gildenmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf6fa48-c1df-4831-b658-f5a9d9bf021a\', \'multiverseId\': 287958}, \'multiverseid\': 287958}, {\'name\': \'Skarrg, los pozos de la furia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{R}{G}, {T}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Este palacio será nuestro espetón y nuestra cena de victoria será príncipe asado. ¡Envíen a los cerdos con antorchas!" —Ghut Rak, mago del gremio Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a289ed5-a8e9-4b69-97fe-59daad8b437d\', \'multiverseId\': 288114}, \'multiverseid\': 288114}, {\'name\': \'Skarrg, les Fosses de rage\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{R}{G}, {T} : La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce palais sera notre tournebroche, et un prince rôti, notre banquet de victoire. Amenez les cochons-torchères ! » —Ghut Rak, ghildmage de Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47657aa3-be57-4912-aa7e-d7efdf68f6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 287802}, \'multiverseid\': 287802}, {\'name\': \'Skarrg, le Fosse della Rabbia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{R}{G}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo palazzo sarà il nostro focolare e il principe arrosto il banchetto della nostra vittoria. Mandate dentro i porci-incendiari!" —Ghut Rak, mago della gilda Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d96d6e-7695-4d5c-93a1-6814743ec971\', \'multiverseId\': 288270}, \'multiverseid\': 288270}, {\'name\': \'怒りの穴蔵、スカルグ\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{R}{G}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「もうすぐ宮殿は肉焼きに、丸焼きの王子は祝勝の皿になるぞ。 松明豚を突っ込ませろ！」 ――グルールのギルド魔道士、ガット・ラック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a218e5-a02f-4f05-9f3a-8d9d0467ea4d\', \'multiverseId\': 288426}, \'multiverseid\': 288426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spross des Hollerwalds\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Lebensverknüpfung\\nZaubersprüche, die du wirkst und die den Spross des Hollerwalds als Ziel haben, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nZaubersprüche, die deine Gegner wirken und die den Spross des Hollerwalds als Ziel haben, kosten beim Wirken {2} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sonnengestrüppduiden glauben, dass jedes Leben in seinem Herzen beginnt und unter seinen Hufen endet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1268e6db-2e0b-4387-bf12-0046dfd2e1ea\', \'multiverseId\': 287859}, \'multiverseid\': 287859}, {\'name\': \'Vástago de Bosque Viejo\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, vínculo vital.\\nTe cuesta {2} menos lanzar hechizos que hagan objetivo al Vástago de Bosque Viejo.\\nLe cuesta {2} más a tus oponentes lanzar hechizos que hagan objetivo al Vástago de Bosque Viejo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Los druidas de Zarza Solar creen que toda vida comienza en su corazón y termina bajo sus cascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c78bc9-504b-4f2c-b058-abdfe986e987\', \'multiverseId\': 288015}, \'multiverseid\': 288015}, {\'name\': \'Scion de Boisaïeul\', \'text\': \'Piétinement, lien de vie\\nLes sorts que vous lancez qui ciblent le Scion de Boisaïeul coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\\nLes sorts que vos adversaires lancent qui ciblent le Scion de Boisaïeul coûtent {2} de plus à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Les druides de Solronce croient que toute vie commence dans son cœur et qu\'elle se termine sous ses sabots.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'324f0868-9607-4733-9821-ab8fcf90e0db\', \'multiverseId\': 287703}, \'multiverseid\': 287703}, {\'name\': \'Rampollo di Boscoantico\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, legame vitale\\nLe magie che lanci e che bersagliano il Rampollo di Boscoantico costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nLe magie che i tuoi avversari lanciano e che bersagliano il Rampollo di Boscoantico costano {2} in più per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'I druidi di Rovoassolato credono che ogni vita cominci nel suo cuore e termini sotto i suoi zoccoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddbbecc-9ff0-4763-8644-5c88613055c3\', \'multiverseId\': 288171}, \'multiverseid\': 288171}, {\'name\': \'老木の末裔\', \'text\': \'トランプル、絆魂\\nあなたが老木の末裔を対象として唱える呪文は、それを唱えるためのコストが{2}少なくなる。\\nあなたの対戦相手が老木の末裔を対象として唱える呪文は、それを唱えるためのコストが{2}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'陽茨のドルイドは、あらゆる生命がその心臓から生まれ、その蹄の下で終わると信じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f66160-64a2-41f9-9328-9273458c5b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 288327}, \'multiverseid\': 288327}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stiller Verfall\', \'text\': \'Artefakt- oder Verzauberungsverzauberung\\nBestimme zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eines — Zerstöre die verzauberte bleibende Karte; oder du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Handwerker haben sich schon immer von der Natur helfen lassen. Jetzt ist die Natur an der Reihe." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10627a7e-5b84-471d-bbe9-5bc7d6955e54\', \'multiverseId\': 287962}, \'multiverseid\': 287962}, {\'name\': \'Deterioro discreto\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto o encantamiento.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, elige uno: Destruye el permanente encantado; o gana 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"El artificio siempre dependió de la naturaleza. Ahora es su turno." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffde95c-d1c8-4ab8-b2ce-1b7e7e3c3193\', \'multiverseId\': 288118}, \'multiverseid\': 288118}, {\'name\': \'Lent délabrement\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact ou enchantement\\nAu début de votre entretien, choisissez l\'un — Détruisez le permanent enchanté ; ou vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« L\'artifice s\'est toujours reposé sur les épaules de la nature pour survivre. Voyons comment la nature va réagir. » —Freyalise", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c07a630-6b57-438d-b339-649e2e76c6f4\', \'multiverseId\': 287806}, \'multiverseid\': 287806}, {\'name\': \'Placido Sfacelo\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto o incantesimo\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, scegli uno — Distruggi il permanente incantato; oppure guadagni 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'artificio ha sempre indugiato sulle spalle della natura. Guardiamo ora la natura che si vendica." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec34bd9-29b1-4477-b31d-a36bae9eff98\', \'multiverseId\': 288274}, \'multiverseid\': 288274}, {\'name\': \'物静かな破損\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクトかエンチャント）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、以下の２つから１つを選ぶ。「エンチャントされているパーマネントを破壊する。」「あなたは２点のライフを得る。」\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「工芸というものは、常に自然の肩口にあるものなのです。 自然が動いたとき、どうなるか見てみましょう。」 ――フレイアリーズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba0e8e3-9886-4652-8b7a-b4b219657412\', \'multiverseId\': 288430}, \'multiverseid\': 288430}]', "[{'name': 'Sumpf', 'type': 'Standardland — Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287979&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5218bba-223c-48ce-81a9-d72f4f35400e', 'multiverseId': 287979}, 'multiverseid': 287979}, {'name': 'Pantano', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Pantano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288135&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8de564df-4d25-4226-9369-cd2d5cde9e1e', 'multiverseId': 288135}, 'multiverseid': 288135}, {'name': 'Marais', 'type': 'Terrain de base : marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287823&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '687b910b-3c87-4aba-8f75-4886b964ce9b', 'multiverseId': 287823}, 'multiverseid': 287823}, {'name': 'Palude', 'type': 'Terra Base — Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288291&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46c72335-0fae-4e66-be9e-35f7067517ae', 'multiverseId': 288291}, 'multiverseid': 288291}, {'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288447&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37321364-c54f-4acd-abf9-83583fd8d5e4', 'multiverseId': 288447}, 'multiverseid': 288447}]", "[{'name': 'Sumpf', 'type': 'Standardland — Sumpf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287984&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0477b691-1ac5-47fd-a068-50817cec1f8c', 'multiverseId': 287984}, 'multiverseid': 287984}, {'name': 'Pantano', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Pantano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288140&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bc90e2e-a4cd-45d4-8641-a201ea07aaa2', 'multiverseId': 288140}, 'multiverseid': 288140}, {'name': 'Marais', 'type': 'Terrain de base : marais', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=287828&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d913e23-05c7-48d3-b547-1177ec1de362', 'multiverseId': 287828}, 'multiverseid': 287828}, {'name': 'Palude', 'type': 'Terra Base — Palude', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=288296&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a76f06e0-6cb9-4707-a735-2cdd0de81a11', 'multiverseId': 288296}, 'multiverseid': 288296}, {